      "exp_en": "Using cupping for poisonous snake bites is an ancient way of treatment. Bensky lists cupping as indicated for poisonous snake bites but research studies using an extractor pump on snake bites showed that suction was ineffective and unlikely in helping reducing the total body venom. Moreover, poisonous snake bites are considered a medical emergency and need immediate medical care. Cupping is contraindicated in high fever, convulsions or cramps, allergic skin conditions, ulcerated sores, over areas where the muscle is thin or skin is not level with the bone, or lower back of pregnant women. It is indicated for arthritis, abdominal pain, stomach pain, indigestion, non-ulcerated furuncle. Cupping therapy for a prolapsed uterus is to apply medium to strong cupping to REN-6, KI-12, ST-29, DU-3, and BL-26. Spondylosis is a general term referring to degeneration of the spinal column from any cause. It refers to spinal osteoarthritis, the age-related wear and tear of the spinal column, Cupping therapy for spondylosis includes medium strength cupping for up to 15 minutes over the affected area followed by acupuncture on the tender points. Cupping using large cups to envelop the whole breast with medium to strong suction can be used for breast enhancement. This is combined with acupuncture treatment on GB-21, ST-15, and ST-18 (directed toward the nipple) can be applied to the breast. The author Chirali states that the results are dependent on the age and weight of the patient. Patients over 20 years old and patients who were severely underweight in relation to their height had poor results. Acupuncture: A Comprehensive Text, Bensky, 1981, page 447; Cupping Therapy, 2nd Edition, Chirali, page 191, 203, 206",
      "exp_hant": "以拔罐治療毒蛇咬傷是一種古老的療法。本斯基（Bensky）將拔罐列為毒蛇咬傷之適應症，但使用抽吸幫浦於蛇咬傷口的研究顯示，此吸引法無效，也不太可能有助於降低全身毒液濃度。此外，毒蛇咬傷屬於醫療急症，需立即就醫。拔罐禁忌於高熱、抽搐或痙攣、過敏性皮膚病、潰瘍性瘡瘍、肌肉薄弱或皮骨不平之部位，以及孕婦腰骶部。拔罐適用於關節炎、腹痛、胃痛、消化不良、未潰瘍之癤腫。治療子宮脫垂時，可於氣海、大赫、歸來、腰陽關、骶部（BL-26/白環俞）以中至強度拔罐。脊椎關節病是泛指由各種原因引起的脊柱退化，指脊椎骨關節炎，即隨年齡增長而產生的脊柱磨損。脊椎關節病之拔罐療法為於患部以中等強度拔罐最多15分鐘，隨後在壓痛點施以針刺。豐胸則可使用大罐包覆整個乳房，以中至強吸力拔罐，並配合肩井、屋翳、乳根（針尖朝向乳頭）等穴位之針刺治療。作者Chirali指出，療效取決於患者的年齡與體重，20歲以上及體重相對身高過輕的患者效果較差。Acupuncture: A Comprehensive Text, Bensky, 1981年版, 第447頁；Cupping Therapy, 第2版, Chirali, 第191、203、206頁"
