      "number": 32,
      "question_en": "A practitioner is taking the medical history of the patient. Which of the following disorders should the practitioner be concerned about when considering the application of moxibustion?",
      "question_hant": "執業者在採集患者病史時，考慮施行艾灸時，應對下列哪些疾病提高警覺？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Buerger's disease, Leriche's syndrome, osteoarthritis",
          "hant": "伯格氏病、勒里什症候群、骨關節炎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "peripheral artery disease, rheumatoid arthritis",
          "hant": "周邊動脈疾病、類風濕性關節炎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "severe asthma, peripheral neuropathies, Beurger's disease",
