        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Add HT-7 (shen men) and REN-12 (zhong wan)",
          "hant": "加神門、中脘",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Add HT-7 (shen men)",
          "hant": "加神門",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Interior, Hot, Deficient, Excess. According to etiology, the diagnosis is Emotional Pathogenic Factor. The organ pattern is Spleen and Heart qi Deficiency and Liver Qi Stagnation Transforming to Heat. The treatment principle is to reinforce the Heart and Spleen qi, regulate Liver qi, and clear heat. In the original treatment, PC-6 reinforces Heart Qi, Calms the Spirit, and regulates Liver qi. SP-4 regulates the Stomach and Spleen Qi, regulates the Large Intestine, and removes Dampness and Phlegm. LR-5, the luo-connecting point, regulates Liver Qi and removes stagnation. GB-13 clears heat, alleviates lateral headaches, and Calms the Spirit. This prescription was not adequately addressing the intercostal distention. GB-44 was selected to benefit the costal region and chest, further Calm the Spirit, Clear the Liver Heat, and benefit the head. The combination of GB-13 and GB-44 are both shao yang points, one at the highest point in the body and the other at the lowest. Both points clear Liver and Gall Bladder Heat and improve sleep caused by Liver or Gall Bladder Heat. HT-7 would reinforce the action of PC-6 in calming the spirit and improving sleep but does not address the distention as well as GB-44. LR-1 is a point mainly selected to regulate lower jiao qi. HT-7 and REN-12 address the Spleen and Heart Qi deficiency but not the Liver qi stagnation causing the intercostal distention. Her BP, pulse, and respiration rate are normal. A right bundle branch block (RBBB) is a defect in the electrical conduction of the heart. Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 37-41",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為裡、熱、虛、實夾雜。就病因而言，診斷為情志病邪所致。臟腑辨證為心脾氣虛兼肝鬱化熱。治療原則為補益心脾之氣、疏肝理氣、清熱。原處方中，內關補心氣、安神、疏肝氣；公孫調理脾胃之氣、調理大腸、袪濕化痰；蠡溝為肝經絡穴，能疏肝理氣、消除鬱滯；本神清熱、緩解側頭痛、安神。此處方對脅肋脹滿之治療並不充分。加足竅陰以利脅肋及胸部、進一步安神、清肝熱及利頭部。本神與足竅陰皆為少陽經穴，一在人體最高處、一在最低處，兩者皆能清肝膽之熱，並改善因肝膽鬱熱所致之睡眠不佳。神門雖能加強內關安神、改善睡眠之效，卻不如足竅陰能兼顧脹滿之症。大敦主要用於調理下焦氣機。神門與中脘雖能改善心脾氣虛，卻無法針對造成脅肋脹滿的肝氣鬱滯。患者血壓、脈搏及呼吸頻率皆屬正常。右束支傳導阻滯（RBBB）是心臟電傳導系統的一種缺陷。Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993年版, Xuemai and Jingyi, 第37-41頁"
    },
