    {
      "number": 75,
      "question_en": "A 41-year old female has a ten-year history of joint pain in the arm and legs, particularly in the small joints of the wrist and hands. The pain is episodic and can be so intense that she has difficulty moving her hands. She also has been experiencing spinal pain. She has been treated with both acupuncture and Chinese herbs which have controlled each episode but her pain has slowly become worse over time. In the last year, she has developed fatigue, palpitations, and SOB on exertion. These symptoms improve with rest. She reports no chest pain but says she has a stifling sensation in the chest area. When fatigue, SOB, and palpitations are severe, she develops edema in the legs with pitting edema in the ankles. She has insomnia. She drinks very little water or other liquids. Urine output is reduced. Appetite and bowels are normal. The tongue body has a normal color with a thin-white-moist coating. The pulse is soft and rather rapid. She is initially treated with warm needle at LI-4 (he gu) threaded to PC-8 (lao gong), and only needle at DU-14 (da zhui), and ST-36 (zu san li). After three treatments she reported a decrease in her hand pain and spine pain. However, all her other symptoms were still there. Which points would you add to the prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一位41歲女性患者有十年手臂與雙腿關節疼痛病史，尤以腕部及手部小關節為甚。疼痛呈陣發性，發作劇烈時甚至難以活動雙手。患者亦有脊背疼痛。曾以針灸及中藥治療，每次發作皆能獲得控制，但疼痛程度隨時間逐漸加重。近一年來，患者出現疲倦、心悸，並於勞累後出現氣短，休息後可緩解。患者訴無胸痛，但胸部有悶塞感。當疲倦、氣短、心悸加重時，雙腿出現水腫，足踝部呈凹陷性水腫。患者並有失眠。飲水量甚少，尿量減少。食慾與大便正常。舌質色澤正常，苔薄白而潤。脈濡略數。初診時以合谷透勞宮溫針，並針大椎、足三里（不加溫針）。三次治療後，患者手部疼痛及脊背疼痛減輕，但其餘症狀依然存在。此時應於處方中加入哪些穴位？",
