      ],
      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis is Interior, Hot, Deficient. The cause is Empty Heat and Qi and Blood xu. The organ pattern is Heart Blood and Yin Deficiency and Spleen Qi Deficiency. The treatment principle is Clear Heat and Calm the Spirit, Nourish Yin and Blood, and Tonify Spleen Qi. DU-13 removes internal heat arising from deficient yin. HT-6 also removes empty heat and calms the Spirit. KI-7 treats excess sweating and clears heat. This three point combination is a small formula for clearing empty heat, particularly with insomnia and night sweats. TB-5 through PC-6 regulate the yin and yang between the shao yang and jue yin channels and calms the mind. There are no points to strengthen Spleen qi which will be addressed once the insomnia resolves. The prescription with REN-12 treats deficiency of Spleen and Heart Blood and does not address the empty heat. The prescription with LR-3 focuses on the Liver. Though there are symptoms and signs (wiry pulse, reduced menstrual blood) pointing to the Liver, the primary problem is deficient Heart yin with empty heat. The Liver symptoms and signs are of secondary importance. The prescription with HT-8 treats Heart Fire Blazing, condition of excess heat while this patient has empty heat. Vital signs (BP, pulse rate, respiration, and body temp) were within normal limits. TSH (Thyroid Stimulating Hormone) was also within normal range which is between 0.5 and 4.0 mu/mL. FYI: she passed her acupuncture exam :-). Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 152-155",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證屬裡證、熱證、虛證，病因為虛熱兼氣血兩虛，臟腑辨證為心血心陰兩虛兼脾氣虛。治療原則為清熱安神、滋陰養血、補益脾氣。陶道能袪除因陰虛所生之內熱；陰郄亦能袪虛熱並安神。此三穴組合為清虛熱之小型處方，尤適用於兼見失眠與盜汗者。外關透內關可調和少陽與厥陰兩經之陰陽並安神。本方未列健脾益氣之穴，此部分將於失眠緩解後再行處理。以中脘為主之處方治脾與心血兩虛，未能針對虛熱。以太衝為主之處方著重於肝，雖患者兼有肝之症狀與體徵（弦脈、經量減少），然其主要病機為心陰虛兼虛熱，肝之症狀與體徵屬次要。以少府為主之處方治心火亢盛（實熱證），而本案屬虛熱。生命徵象（血壓、脈搏、呼吸及體溫）皆在正常範圍內。TSH（促甲狀腺激素）亦在正常範圍（0.5至4.0 mu/mL之間）。附註：她順利通過了針灸考試 :-)。Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi，第152-155頁"
