          "key": "C",
          "en": "Vacuity Cold, Repletion Cold, Blood Vacuity",
          "hant": "虛寒、實寒、血虛",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Vacuity Heat, Blood Vacuity",
          "hant": "虛熱、血虛",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. When menstruation arrives 8-9 days after the time it should arrive or it arrives every 40-50 days it is considered delayed menstruation. With Vacuity Heat there is an early period with a scanty amount of blood that is red and thin. When the Blood is cold the menses become delayed. With Repletion Cold there is a delayed period with clear-thin-dark-red and scanty menses. There can be abdominal pain that improves with heat and worsen with massage. Vacuity Cold has a late period with dull-scanty-thin menses with abdominal pain that improves with warmth and massage. Blood Vacuity and also Qi Stasis can both cause delayed menstruation. Blood Vacuity has a late period with scanty-pale menses with lingering abdominal pain after menstruation. Qi Stasis can have a delayed period caused by an impaired Liver not ensuring a free-flow of qi. Here the menstrual blood can be normal and the amount can be either scanty or copious. There is also distending pain in the lower abdomen. Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999, page 359-360",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且正確之答案。當月經延遲8至9日方至，或每40至50日方行一次，即視為月經延後。虛熱者，經期提前，經量少而色紅質稀。血分受寒則月經延後。實寒者，經期延後，經色暗淡質清稀而量少，可伴有腹痛，得熱則減、按之加重。虛寒者，經期延後，經色暗淡、量少質稀，腹痛得溫按則減。血虛與氣滯亦皆可致月經延後：血虛者經期延後，量少色淡，經後腹痛隱隱不止；氣滯者則因肝失疏泄而致經期延後，經血可正常，經量或少或多，並伴有小腹脹痛。Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999年版，第359-360頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 120,
      "question_en": "A 29 year-old female has irregular menstruation. She has a shortened cycle. The menses are profuse, thin, and with a light red color. She has shortness of breath and palpitations after climbing stairs. She has a sensation of emptiness and heaviness in the lower abdomen. The tongue is pale with thin white coating. She received the following acupuncture prescription: REN-6 (qi hai), SP-6 (san yin jiao), REN-12 (zhong wan), and ST-36 (zu san li). After a course of treatment her condition improves. Three months after the last treatment she returns and now complains of delayed menses which are scanty and light red. She has dizziness, blurry vision, palpitations, insomnia, and shortness of breath. The tongue is pink with little coating. What is the treatment now?",
      "question_hant": "一位29歲女性月經不規律，週期縮短，經量多、質稀、色淡紅。爬樓梯後出現氣短與心悸，並有小腹空墜及沉重感。舌淡，苔薄白。曾接受以下針灸處方：氣海、三陰交、中脘、足三里。經一療程治療後病情改善。末次治療後三個月，患者再度就診，主訴月經延後，經量少而色淡紅，並有頭暈、視物模糊、心悸、失眠及氣短。舌淡紅，苔少。此時應如何治療？",
