    {
      "number": 181,
      "question_en": "Cupping dosage is controlled through the",
      "question_hant": "拔罐的治療劑量是透過以下哪些因素來控制？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "amount of pressure applied in each cup, length of time the cups are left in place",
          "hant": "每個罐所施加的壓力大小、留罐的時間長短",
