          "en": "number of cups used in treatment, amount of pressure applied in each cup, length of time the cups are left in place",
          "hant": "治療時所用罐的數量、每個罐所施加的壓力大小、留罐的時間長短",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "time of day the treatment is given, number of cups used in treatment, length of time the cups are left in place",
          "hant": "治療施行的時段、治療時所用罐的數量、留罐的時間長短",
