        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "number of cups used in treatment, length of time the cups are left in place",
          "hant": "治療時所用罐的數量、留罐的時間長短",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. There are no indications in the text regarding time of day for cupping. For a patient who has a repletion or excess disorder more cups can be applied with more pressure and for a longer period of time. For patients with extreme vacuity or deficiency, apply fewer cups, less pressure, and shorter duration. For a relatively healthy patient, 5-7 cups are used, and are left in place 3-5 minutes. For a vacuous patient, 2-3 cups are used with lighter suction, and left in place from 20 seconds to 2 minutes. For a replete patient, 7-10 cups are used with stronger suction, and left in place 5-10 minutes. Electric or manual vacuum pumps allow you to control the amount of pressure or suction. Japanese Acupuncture, 1998, Birch and Ida, page 189",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且準確的答案。文獻中並未提及與拔罐時段相關的規定。對於實證或邪盛的病患，可使用較多罐數、較強的吸力，並留罐較長時間；對於極度虛弱或虛證的病患，則應使用較少罐數、較輕的吸力，並縮短留罐時間。體質較為健康者，可用5至7個罐，留罐3至5分鐘。虛證病患則用2至3個罐，吸力較輕，留罐20秒至2分鐘。實證病患則用7至10個罐，吸力較強，留罐5至10分鐘。電動或手動抽氣式拔罐器可用來控制吸力大小。《Japanese Acupuncture》，1998年，Birch and Ida，189頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 182,
      "question_en": "A 37 year-old female was diagnosed with fibromyalgia five years ago. She reports a recent attack started two days ago after being caught in a heavy rain while taking a walk. She says that her muscles hurt a lot, that her body feels heavy, and she feels physically lazy and inert. Asked about her menstrual cycle, she says that the blood is dark. One can see that she also has a dark complexion. The tongue has a thick-sticky coating. The pulse is slippery. The treatment principle was Resolve Dampness and Move Qi. She received daily treatments for five days. On her check up visit, she reports that the worst is over and now has returned to her \"regular\" fibromyalgia symptoms. These symptoms are achy muscles (particularly fixed, boring pain in the upper back area) which are worse in damp weather. She says her limbs feel like dead weight and numb. She is often fatigued. While waiting to fall asleep, she has restless legs and her mind is agitated. During the night her joint and muscle pain worsen to the point of startling her into waking up. The tongue coating is normal. The pulse has become wiry. What is your treatment principle now?",
      "question_hant": "一位37歲女性五年前被診斷為纖維肌痛症。她表示最近一次的發作始於兩天前，因散步時遭遇大雨淋濕所致。她說肌肉非常疼痛，身體感覺沉重，且感到懶散、倦怠。詢問月經狀況後，她表示經血色暗。可見她的面色也偏暗沉。舌苔厚膩，脈滑。治療原則訂為化濕、行氣，連續治療五天。回診時她表示最嚴重的階段已過，目前回到她「一般」的纖維肌痛症狀。這些症狀為肌肉痠痛（尤其是上背部的固定性、鑽痛感），於潮濕天氣時加重。她表示四肢感覺如同死物般沉重且麻木，時常疲倦。等待入睡時會出現不寧腿，心神不安。夜間關節與肌肉疼痛加劇，甚至痛醒。舌苔已恢復正常，脈象轉為弦。此時您的治療原則為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Move Qi, Invigorate Blood, Eliminate Stasis, Transform Dampness",
          "hant": "行氣、活血、化瘀、化濕",
