          "hant": "化濕、行氣、安神",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Transform Dampness, Tonify Spleen",
          "hant": "化濕、補脾",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Tonify Spleen, Tonify Heart Blood, Calm the Mind",
          "hant": "補脾、補心血、安神",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "From a TCM point of view, fibromyalgia is associated primarily with Dampness (though Cold and Wind can be involved), entering the body and chronically lodging itself in the muscle channels and in the luo-connecting vessels located in the superficial energetic wei-qi layer between the skin and muscles. The Dampness pathogen can be associated with patterns of Qi Stasis, Spleen Qi/Yang Deficiency, Liver-Kidney Yin Xu, Liver Blood Xu, or Blood Stasis. The initial clinical picture of the patient indicates an acute attack of Dampness worsening her pre-existing condition. As the manifestation (biao) is strong, the focus of the treatment should be on resolving and transforming Dampness and moving Qi. After the initial cycle of treatment, her pain attenuated and the thick-sticky tongue coating was resolved. Now one can see the underlying pattern of qi and blood stasis (fixed boring pain, pain worse at night, dark complexion, dark menstrual blood). The fact that the blood is stagnant indicates a deeper progression of the Dampness pathogen impeding the deep luo-connecting channels at the blood level. The treatment principle now focuses on Move Qi, Invigorate Blood, Eliminate Stasis, and Transform Dampness. The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2008, page 1097-1105, 1115, 1119",
      "exp_hant": "從中醫角度而言，纖維肌痛症主要與濕邪相關（雖然寒與風亦可能參與其中），濕邪侵入人體後，慢性滯留於肌肉經筋及位於皮肉之間衛氣淺層的絡脈之中。此濕邪可兼夾氣滯、脾氣（陽）虛、肝腎陰虛、肝血虛或血瘀等證型。病患最初的臨床表現顯示急性濕邪發作，使原有病情加重。由於標證明顯，治療重點應放在化濕與行氣。經過初期一個療程的治療後，疼痛減輕，舌苔厚膩之象亦已消退。此時可見其潛在的氣血瘀滯之證（固定性鑽痛、夜間疼痛加重、面色暗沉、經血色暗）。血分瘀滯的表現顯示濕邪已深入發展，阻滯深層絡脈於血分。此時治療原則應轉為行氣、活血、化瘀、化濕。《The Practice of Chinese Medicine》，Maciocia，2008年，1097-1105、1115、1119頁"
