      "number": 208,
      "question_en": "In a flexion deformity of the hip, as the opposite hip is flexed with the thigh against the chest, the affected hip",
      "question_hant": "在髖關節屈曲攣縮的病患中，當對側髖關節屈曲、大腿貼近胸部時，患側髖關節會出現什麼情形？",
