      "exp_en": "There are actually two pacemakers. The SA node is the primary. The atrioventricular node (AV node), located in a bundle of tissues on the border between the right atrium in the wall that separates the right atrium and right ventricle. When the SA node sends out an electrical impulse, the first place it goes is to the AV node. While the SA node sets the rhythm of your pulse, the AV node sets the rhythm of your heart contractions. tcmtests.com, March 2020",
      "exp_hant": "心臟其實有兩個節律點。竇房結（SA node）為主要節律點。房室結（AV node）則位於一束組織中，處於右心房與分隔右心房及右心室之間隔壁的交界處。當竇房結發出電衝動時，會先傳導至房室結。竇房結設定的是脈搏的節律，而房室結設定的則是心臟收縮的節律。tcmtests.com，2020年3月"
