      "exp_en": "Breakthrough varicella zoster virus (VZV) is a subtype and milder form of chicken pox. The description of the rash as maculopapular with vesicles, low-grade fever, cough, rhinitis, absence of cervical lymphadenopathy point to chicken pox. In breakthrough VZV there are fewer, if any, vesicles. Breakthrough VZV can occur when a child did not complete her immunizations. In contrast, the \"wild type\" or classic type of chicken pox there can be 300-400 or more vesicles. The breakthrough type presents less acutely than the classic wild-type of VZV. VZV is the cause of both chicken pox and herpes zoster (shingles). Even though the same virus causes shingles, shingles develop later AFTER an initial outbreak of chicken pox earlier in life. Also, the distribution of the rash in shingles is limited to one dermatome. Scarlet fever has a bright red rash on the body, usually accompanied by a high fever and sore throat. The same bacteria that cause strep throat also cause scarlet fever. Scarlet fever has a \"sandpaper rash\" and is without vesicles. Tinea corporis, known as ringworm, is a fungal infection. Tinea corporis may begin as flat red patches and then spreads out in a circle or ring, leaving normal-looking skin in the middle. At the edge of the ring, the skin is red and raised. Diagnostic tests can be done to reveal the cause of the rash (virus, bacteria, fungal). The Tzank smear of a vesicle scraping will show that the rash is caused by VZV. A potassium hydroxide (KOH) smear test can detect fungi growth. In the presence of a sore throat and rash, a bacterial culture can be done. Clinical Case Studies for the Family Nurse Practitioner, Leslie Neal-Boylan, 2011, page 113-115",
      "exp_hant": "突破性水痘帶狀皰疹病毒（VZV）感染是水痘的一種較輕型亞型。此案例中描述的斑丘疹伴水泡、低度發燒、咳嗽、鼻炎，以及頸部淋巴結未腫大等表現，皆指向水痘。突破性VZV感染的水泡數量較少，甚至可能不明顯，通常發生於疫苗接種未完成的兒童身上。相對地，「野生型」或典型水痘則可能出現300至400個以上的水泡，且病程較突破性感染更為急性。VZV同時是水痘與帶狀皰疹的病因；儘管由同一種病毒引起，帶狀皰疹是在幼年首次感染水痘之後、經過一段時間才發生，且其皮疹分布僅侷限於單一皮節。猩紅熱的皮疹則呈鮮紅色，通常伴隨高燒及喉嚨痛，其致病菌與造成鏈球菌性喉炎的細菌相同；猩紅熱皮疹呈「砂紙狀」，不會出現水泡。體癬（俗稱金錢癬）則是一種黴菌感染，通常先以扁平紅斑出現，之後向外擴散成環狀或圓圈狀，中央皮膚恢復正常外觀，環的邊緣則呈紅色隆起。可透過相關檢查判斷皮疹病因（病毒、細菌或黴菌）：刮取水泡進行Tzanck抹片檢查可確認是否為VZV所致；氫氧化鉀（KOH）抹片檢查可偵測黴菌生長；若同時有喉嚨痛與皮疹，則可進行細菌培養。《家庭護理師臨床案例研究》，Leslie Neal-Boylan著，2011年，第113-115頁"
    },
