        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "A stuck needle is when the acupuncturist has difficulty rotating, lifting, or withdrawing the needle. The cause of a stuck needle is often due to the patient moving after the needles have been inserted or the acupuncturist's excessive needle manipulation or needling too deeply into the muscle layer. It is strongly recommended to needle the point to the recommended depth and then use the correct needle stimulation technique for needles inserted below the subcutaneous tissue. Research suggests that collagen fibers cause the stuck needle phenomenon. When this occurs, reassure the patient if they are nervous. Ask them to relax their muscles. You can leave the stuck needle in place for a few minutes then try again. You can also massage the area around the point. If massage or tapping does not work you can needle a nearby point to help relax the area. You can also slightly rotate the needle in the opposite direction until the needle becomes loose. If the patient movement during the treatment caused the stuck needle, then put the patient to the original position before attempting the removal of the needle. Remind the patient of the importance of being still during treatment. Clean Needle Technique, 7th Edition, page 8",
      "exp_hant": "卡針是指針灸師在旋轉、提插或起針時感到困難的情況。造成卡針的原因，通常是患者在下針後移動身體，或針灸師手法操作過度、進針過深至肌肉層所致。強烈建議依建議深度下針，並在針身進入皮下組織之後，採用正確的行針手法。研究顯示，膠原纖維纏繞是造成卡針現象的原因。發生卡針時，若患者感到緊張，應先安撫其情緒，請其放鬆肌肉。可將卡住的針留置數分鐘後再嘗試起針，也可按摩穴位周圍區域；若按摩或輕拍無效，可於附近穴位加針以協助放鬆該區域，也可將針稍微朝反方向轉動，直到針身鬆動為止。若卡針是因治療過程中患者移動姿勢所致，應先讓患者恢復原本姿勢，再嘗試起針，並提醒患者治療期間保持不動的重要性。《潔淨針法》第7版，第8頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 244,
      "question_en": "What is the most important procedure for preventing an infection in a health care setting?",
      "question_hant": "在醫療照護場所中，預防感染最重要的措施為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Sterilization of all equipment that pierces the skin",
          "hant": "將所有穿刺皮膚的器械滅菌",
          "correct": false
