      "number": 265,
      "question_en": "A patient has spent too much time in the sun. He complains of cramping muscles in the leg. What can you give the person?",
      "question_hant": "一名患者曬太陽時間過久，主訴腿部肌肉抽筋。你可以給予患者什麼？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "sports drink or salt tablets",
          "hant": "運動飲料或鹽片",
