      "exp_en": "COLON CANCER: All men and women of average risk should start testing and screening at age 45. Testing is recommended up through age 75. People aged 76 to 85 should talk with their health care provider. Prostate cancer: Starting at age 45, men at higher than average risk of prostate cancer should talk with a doctors to be tested. Men with more than one close relative with prostate cancer before age 65 are at at greater risk and should talk with a doctor about testing starting at age 40. LUNG CANCER: If 55 or older, the patient should talk to a health care provider about smoking history and whether to get yearly low-dose CT scans to screen for early lung cancer. BREAST CANCER: Women at age 45 of average risk should get a mammogram every year. Women ages 40 to 44 should have the choice to start annual breast cancer screening with mammograms if they wish to do so. For age 55 and older, women should get a mammogram every 2 years or can choose to get one every year. CERVICAL CANCER: Starting at age 25, women can have pap test and an HPV test done every 5 years (preferred approach) or get just a Pap test every 3 years. cancer.org",
      "exp_hant": "大腸癌：所有風險屬平均值的男性與女性，皆應於45歲開始進行大腸癌檢測與篩檢，建議篩檢持續至75歲；76至85歲者應與醫療照護提供者討論是否繼續篩檢。攝護腺癌：攝護腺癌風險高於平均值的男性，應自45歲起與醫師討論檢測事宜；若有一位以上近親於65歲前罹患攝護腺癌，則屬於高風險族群，應自40歲起與醫師討論檢測事宜。肺癌：55歲以上患者應與醫療照護提供者討論吸菸史，並評估是否應每年接受低劑量電腦斷層掃描以篩檢早期肺癌。乳癌：風險屬平均值的45歲女性應每年接受乳房攝影檢查；40至44歲女性則可依個人意願選擇是否開始每年接受乳房攝影篩檢；55歲以上女性則應每兩年接受一次乳房攝影，也可選擇每年接受一次。子宮頸癌：女性自25歲起，可選擇每五年接受一次子宮頸抹片檢查合併HPV檢測（較建議的方式），或每三年單獨接受一次子宮頸抹片檢查。cancer.org"
