      ],
      "exp_en": "The OTC brand Immodium A-D and Lomatil have loperamide which is actually an opioid. It is different than most other opioids in that it does not cross the the blood-brain barrier. That means that loperamide does not effect the opioid brain receptors, which is where other opioids produce their pain-relieving and euphoric properties. Loperamide, instead, acts on opioid receptors in the digestive system to slow down the intestines, to relieve diarrhea. The OTC brands Kaopectate and Pepto-Bismol have bismuth subsalicylate which is to coat the GI tract to reduce inflammation and to kill some of the bacteria that can cause diarrhea. The subsalicylate is related to aspirin. Bismuth subsalicylate also prevents the attachment of bacteria to the walls of the intestine. The focus of treatment for loperamide is diarrhea. Bismuth subsalicylate can treat diarrhea, upset stomach, indigestion, and heart burn. Both loperamide and bismuth subsalicylate decrease the flow of fluids and electrolytes into the bowels. Loperamide (Immodium A-D, Lamotil) slows the movement of fluids through the intestine and reduces the frequency and volume of the stools. Loperamide treats only the symptoms, not the cause of the diarrhea (infection) whereas bismuth subsalicylate can kill some of the bacteria that is causing the diarrhea. Bismuth subsalicylate (Pepto-Bismol, Kaopectate) reduces inflammation of the intestines and kills some bacteria that cause diarrhea. OTC Antidiarrheals are not recommended for diarrhea caused by infection with bacteria or a parasite. In such cases, the drug is likely to trap the organism in the intestines and actually prolong the diarrhea. Physicians may prescribe certain antibiotics instead of antidiarrheals for such types of diarrhea. Calcium carbonate is an antacid that neutralizes stomach acid. tcmtests.com, February 2019",
      "exp_hant": "非處方品牌Immodium A-D與Lomatil含有洛哌丁胺，其實屬於類鴉片藥物，但與大多數類鴉片藥物不同，它不會通過血腦屏障，因此不會作用於腦部的類鴉片受體（其他類鴉片藥物即透過此受體產生止痛及欣快感），而是作用於消化系統中的類鴉片受體，藉此減緩腸道蠕動以緩解腹瀉。非處方品牌Kaopectate與Pepto-Bismol則含有次水楊酸鉍，其作用是覆蓋於腸胃道表面，減少發炎並殺死部分導致腹瀉的細菌；次水楊酸鉍與阿斯匹靈屬同類物質，也能防止細菌附著於腸壁。洛哌丁胺的治療重點在於腹瀉本身，次水楊酸鉍則可治療腹瀉、胃部不適、消化不良及胃灼熱。洛哌丁胺與次水楊酸鉍皆能減少流入腸道的體液與電解質量。洛哌丁胺（Immodium A-D、Lamotil）可減緩腸道內體液的移動速度，降低排便的頻率與量，但僅治療腹瀉的症狀，而非病因（感染）；次水楊酸鉍則能殺死部分引起腹瀉的細菌。次水楊酸鉍（Pepto-Bismol、Kaopectate）可減少腸道發炎並殺死部分致病細菌。對於因細菌或寄生蟲感染所引起的腹瀉，並不建議使用非處方止瀉藥，因為這類藥物可能將病原體滯留於腸道內，反而延長腹瀉時間；此類腹瀉，醫師可能會開立特定抗生素而非止瀉藥。碳酸鈣則屬於中和胃酸的制酸劑。tcmtests.com，2019年2月"
