      "number": 285,
      "question_en": "Ramon is a 37 year-old bus driver born in Bolivia. He goes to the doctor complaining of swelling of his feet, mild shortness of breath, and trouble lying flat at night. He says he sleeps best in a chair. He feels drowsy when he drives a bus so he takes NoDoz to stay awake. Examination reveals 3+ pitting edema of both ankles extending up to mid-calf. There are no varicose veins. His lungs have fine rales in both lung bases. His liver is palpable three fingerbreadths below the right costal margin. His jugular veins are prominent when he lies down. What is most likely diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "Ramon是一名37歲的公車司機，出生於玻利維亞。他因雙腳腫脹、輕度呼吸急促及夜間無法平躺就醫。他說坐在椅子上睡覺最舒服。開車時容易感到昏昏欲睡，因此服用NoDoz（含咖啡因藥物）來保持清醒。理學檢查發現雙側踝部有3+的凹陷性水腫，延伸至小腿中段。沒有靜脈曲張。雙側肺底可聽到細濕囉音。肝臟可在右肋緣下觸及三指寬處。平躺時頸靜脈明顯怒張。最可能的診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Insomnia with apnea",
          "hant": "失眠合併呼吸暫停",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Congestive heart failure",
          "hant": "鬱血性心臟衰竭",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Pulmonary emphysema",
          "hant": "肺氣腫",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Chronic fatigue",
          "hant": "慢性疲勞",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Congestive heart failure (CHF) is due to weak heart muscles with insufficient strength to pump blood that leads to fluid accumulation in the lungs and body. The heart fails to supply the body with enough oxygen. Due to a weak heart, the kidneys retain fluid and salt resulting in edema in the body. The cause of CHF can include coronary artery disease, hypertension, heart valve disorders, kidney disease, and diabetes, etc. Symptoms of CHF include congested lungs due to fluids in the lungs (cough, SOB, wheezing, labored breathing, difficulty breathing when lying down), edema (swollen ankles, swollen abdomen, weight gain), fatigue and confusion (due to lack of oxygen and nutrients), and heart rhythm disorder (irregular or rapid). One of the tests to diagnose CHF include chest x-ray to show the size of the heart, EKG to evaluate heart electrical activity, a BNP (B-type Natriuretic Peptide) blood test that reveals BNP levels which are high with CHF, an echocardiogram (ultrasound to show heart movement and structure), ejection Fraction (EF) to evaluate the strength of the heart pumping action. Some drug treatment for CHF include ACE inhibitors, digoxin, diuretics, and beta-blockers. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, page 117, 708",
      "exp_hant": "鬱血性心臟衰竭（CHF）是由於心肌無力，收縮強度不足以有效將血液打出，導致液體堆積於肺部及全身。心臟無法為身體提供足夠的氧氣。由於心臟功能不佳，腎臟會滯留水分與鹽分，造成全身水腫。CHF的病因可能包括冠狀動脈疾病、高血壓、心臟瓣膜疾病、腎臟疾病及糖尿病等。CHF的症狀包括因肺部積液造成的肺鬱血（咳嗽、呼吸急促、喘鳴、呼吸費力、平躺時呼吸困難）、水腫（踝部腫脹、腹部腫脹、體重增加）、疲勞與意識混亂（因缺氧與營養不足所致），以及心律不整（不規則或過快）。診斷CHF的檢查包括胸部X光（觀察心臟大小）、心電圖（評估心臟電活動）、BNP（B型利鈉肽）血液檢測（CHF患者BNP濃度會升高）、心臟超音波（觀察心臟運動與結構）、以及射血分數（EF，評估心臟幫浦收縮力）。CHF的部分藥物治療包括ACE抑制劑、毛地黃（digoxin）、利尿劑及乙型阻斷劑。《生醫學：針灸與東方醫學執業者教科書》，2007年，Robinson著，第117、708頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 286,
      "question_en": "Which drugs are used in the treatment of bipolar disorder?",
      "question_hant": "下列哪些藥物用於治療雙相情感障礙（躁鬱症）？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "atypical antipsychotics, lithium, antidepressants",
          "hant": "非典型抗精神病藥、鋰鹽、抗憂鬱藥",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "anticonvulsants, lithium, antidepressants",
          "hant": "抗癲癇藥、鋰鹽、抗憂鬱藥",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "anticonvulsants, lithium",
          "hant": "抗癲癇藥、鋰鹽",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "atypical antipsychotics, anticonvulsants, lithium",
          "hant": "非典型抗精神病藥、抗癲癇藥、鋰鹽",
