      "exp_en": "Beta-agonists mainly affect the muscles around the bronchi and bronchioles. When the lungs are irritated, the muscle around the airways tighten, resulting in narrow air passages. This often results in breathlessness. Beta-agonists relax the muscles around the bronchi and bronchioles resulting in easier breathing. There are two types of beta-agonist. They are classified by how long they work. These two types are called short-acting or long-acting. Beta-agonists are mostly prescribed as inhalers. Ventolin, Alupent, and Brethine are short-acting beta-agonists. An example of a long-acting beta-agonist is Serevent (salmeterol). tcmtests.com, June 2020",
      "exp_hant": "乙型交感神經促效劑主要作用於支氣管及細支氣管周圍的肌肉。當肺部受到刺激時，氣道周圍的肌肉會收縮，導致氣道變窄，常引起呼吸困難。乙型交感神經促效劑能放鬆支氣管及細支氣管周圍的肌肉，使呼吸更為順暢。乙型交感神經促效劑依作用時間長短分為兩類：短效型與長效型，且多以吸入劑型使用。Ventolin、Alupent及Brethine皆屬短效型乙型交感神經促效劑；長效型的例子則有Serevent（salmeterol，沙美特羅）。tcmtests.com，2020年6月"
