        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Acute renal failure, Adrenal disorders, Acid-base imbalance",
          "hant": "急性腎衰竭、腎上腺疾病、酸鹼失衡",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "UTIs, Acute renal failure, Acid-base imbalance",
          "hant": "泌尿道感染、急性腎衰竭、酸鹼失衡",
