    {
      "number": 304,
      "question_en": "There are two types of glaucoma, open angle and closed angle types. Which of the following is an accurate statement regarding glaucoma?",
      "question_hant": "青光眼分為隅角開放型與隅角閉鎖型兩種。下列關於青光眼的敘述何者正確？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "the most common type of glaucoma is the closed angle type",
          "hant": "最常見的青光眼類型是隅角閉鎖型",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "both types of glaucoma have clogged fluid drainage eye canals",
          "hant": "兩種類型的青光眼皆有眼內液體排出通道阻塞的情形",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "both types of glaucoma start with a loss of central vision",
          "hant": "兩種類型的青光眼皆以中心視力喪失為初期表現",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "the open angle glaucoma type develops very quickly",
          "hant": "隅角開放型青光眼發展速度非常快",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Glaucoma is a group of eye diseases that affects the optic nerve. The optic nerve transmits electrical impulses formed by the retina to the visual cortex of the brain. The optic nerve becomes damaged by glaucoma due to an increase of intraocular pressure (IOP). Glaucoma is a leading cause of blindness. Fluid drains out of the eye through a system of canals. Glaucoma occurs when the drainage system of the eye becomes blocked resulting in an imbalance between how much fluid remains in the eye and how much drains away. The build up of fluids increases pressure on the optic nerve causing glaucoma. Diabetic neuropathy can also create the conditions that produce glaucoma. There are two types of glaucoma, the open angle type and the closed angle type. The angle refers to the relationship between the iris (part that determines eye color) and cornea (thick white tissue that covers the eye). When the iris and cornea move closer together, it \"closes the angle\" between them. When they move away from each other, it \"opens the angle\" between them. The most common type of glaucoma is the open angle type which is a chronic condition that develops slowly. In the chronic open angle type the drainage canals are slowly clogged, resulting in increased eye pressure. This type usually results from aging of the drainage channel. The patient usually does not notice any symptoms. Regular eye exams by measuring intraocular pressure helps to detect open angle glaucoma. The closed angle type is an acute condition that develops quickly. It is caused by sudden blockage of the drainage canals, resulting in a sudden rise in intraocular pressure. This type has symptoms (blurred vision, severe headaches, eye pain, nausea, vomiting) which are very noticeable by the patient. The acute closed angle type demands immediate medical attention. The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page 905-912",
      "exp_hant": "青光眼是一組影響視神經的眼部疾病。視神經負責將視網膜形成的電訊號傳送至大腦的視覺皮質。青光眼會因眼內壓（IOP）升高而損害視神經，是導致失明的主要原因之一。眼內液體透過一套管道系統排出眼外，當此排水系統阻塞時，眼內液體滯留量與排出量之間便會失衡，進而形成青光眼；液體的堆積會增加視神經所承受的壓力，導致青光眼。糖尿病神經病變也可能形成引發青光眼的條件。青光眼分為隅角開放型與隅角閉鎖型兩種，「隅角」是指虹膜（決定眼睛顏色的部位）與角膜（覆蓋眼球的厚實白色組織）之間的關係。當虹膜與角膜彼此靠近時，稱為「隅角變窄（閉鎖）」；當兩者彼此遠離時，則稱為「隅角開放」。最常見的青光眼類型為隅角開放型，屬於發展緩慢的慢性病症。在慢性隅角開放型青光眼中，排水管道會逐漸阻塞，導致眼壓逐漸升高，通常由排水通道老化所致，患者通常不會察覺任何症狀，須透過定期眼科檢查測量眼內壓才能發現。隅角閉鎖型則屬急性病症，發展迅速，是由排水管道突然阻塞造成眼內壓急遽上升所致，其症狀（視力模糊、劇烈頭痛、眼痛、噁心、嘔吐）非常明顯，患者容易察覺。急性隅角閉鎖型青光眼需要立即就醫治療。《默克診療手冊》第18版，第905-912頁"
    },
