      "number": 305,
      "question_en": "From what age does the risk for prostate cancer start to increase?",
      "question_hant": "攝護腺癌的風險從幾歲開始增加？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "60",
          "hant": "60歲",
          "correct": false
