      "exp_en": "There is no dermatome C1. Dermatome L5 is associated with the anterior ankle. Dermatome L1 is associated with the groin. Dermatome C4 is associated with the clavicle.. The cervical dermatones are C2 - C8. Dermatome C2 is the back of the head. There are 30 dermatomes (C1 has no dermatome) which correspond and are numbered according to the spinal vertebral level from which they originate. Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 13th Edition, page 884-885; Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 10th Edition, page 694-695",
      "exp_hant": "並無C1皮節。L5皮節對應踝關節前側；L1皮節對應鼠蹊部；C4皮節對應鎖骨。頸部皮節為C2至C8，C2皮節對應後腦勺。共有30個皮節（C1並無對應皮節），依其起源的脊椎節段編號對應。《Bate氏理學檢查指南》第13版，第884-885頁；《Bate氏理學檢查指南》第10版，第694-695頁"
