      "exp_en": "Hawkins test is forward flexion of the shoulder to 90 degrees while forcibly internally rotating the shoulder. This test best identifies supraspinatus tendon impingement and is more sensitive than Neer's test for impingement.",
      "exp_hant": "霍金斯測試是將肩關節前屈至90度，同時用力使肩關節內旋。此測試最能辨識棘上肌肌腱夾擠，且對夾擠症候群的敏感度優於尼爾氏測試。"
