    {
      "number": 317,
      "question_en": "How is the term \"antiseptic\" defined?",
      "question_hant": "「消毒劑（antiseptic）」一詞如何定義？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "substance that prevents/arrests microorganism growth",
          "hant": "能抑制／阻止微生物生長的物質",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "substance that kills bacteria",
          "hant": "能殺死細菌的物質",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "techniques that prevent infection during invasive procedure",
          "hant": "在侵入性處置中預防感染的技術",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "techniques that prevent contact with microorganisms",
          "hant": "防止接觸微生物的技術",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Antiseptics are substances that slow or prevent the growth of microorganisms by inhibiting their activity or killing them. Antiseptic is a term used for preparations applied topically. Microorganism refers to bacteria, fungi, viruses, and bacterial spores. A bactericide is a substance that focuses on killing bacteria. An aseptic technique is a technique that prevent infection during an invasive procedure such as surgery. Acupuncture is not considered an invasive procedure. Asepsis is a condition in which no living disease-causing microorganisms are present. Surgical asepsis is protection against infection before, during, and after surgery by using sterile techniques. Clean Needle Technique, 7th Edition, page 227, 230",
      "exp_hant": "消毒劑是指能抑制或阻止微生物生長的物質，其作用方式為抑制微生物活性或將其殺死。「消毒劑」一詞用於外用製劑。「微生物」是指細菌、真菌、病毒及細菌孢子。殺菌劑（bactericide）則專指能殺死細菌的物質。無菌技術（aseptic technique）是指在侵入性處置（如手術）過程中預防感染的技術，針灸並不被視為侵入性處置。「無菌狀態」（asepsis）是指不存在任何有生命的致病微生物；外科無菌則是指在手術前、中、後透過無菌技術以防止感染。《清潔針法技術》第7版，第227、230頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 318,
      "question_en": "An active 43 year-old male has back pain as the chief complaint. He describes that he was lifting boxes and at one point felt his lower back \"catch\". Later during the day he could not comfortably sit, lie down, or stand. Two days later he experienced electric \"shocks\" and tingling sensations down the right leg and ball of foot. During the examination he could only flex the lumbar spine about five degrees. If he went further than that, he would feel a jolt down the right leg and foot. If he stood on his heels, the right foot dropped to the floor. The right plantar reflexes were diminished as compared to the left side. There was no muscle atrophy or loss of muscle tone in the right leg. There was numbness of sensation around his right ankle. Which of the following actions would you take?",
      "question_hant": "一名活躍的43歲男性主訴背痛。他描述在搬箱子時，突然感覺下背部「卡住」。當天稍晚他無法舒適地坐下、躺下或站立。兩天後，他右腿及腳掌出現如電擊般的「觸電感」及刺麻感。檢查時，他的腰椎僅能屈曲約五度，若再往前彎，則會感覺右腿與腳部出現一陣觸電感。若以腳跟站立，右腳會下垂無法抬起。與左側相比，右側蹠反射減弱。右腿並無肌肉萎縮或肌張力喪失。右踝周圍有麻木感。您會採取下列何種處置？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "treat with acupuncture with a semi-urgent referral to their physician",
          "hant": "予以針灸治療，並半緊急轉介至其醫師",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "treat with acupuncture with a non-urgent referral to a neurosurgeon",
          "hant": "予以針灸治療，並非緊急轉介至神經外科醫師",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "do not treat with acupuncture; call 911",
          "hant": "不予針灸治療，撥打911",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "treat with acupuncture with an urgent referral to a neurosurgeon",
          "hant": "予以針灸治療，並緊急轉介至神經外科醫師",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The red flag is low back pain with progressive leg numbness, tingling, and weakness. Compression neuropathy from lumbar nerve root pressure (radiculopathy) is assumed until proven otherwise. The type of referral depends on the severity. GRADE 1: the back is mildly painful with intermittent paresthesia in buttock, hip, and/or leg. There are no sensory, motor or reflex impairment in the lower extremity. In grade 1 there is no compression of motor fibers and sensory fibers are minimally compressed. ACTION: no immediate referral is necessary. GRADE 2: back moderately painful with constant paresthesia and objective sensory loss in buttock, leg and/or foot. In grade 2 sensory fibers are significantly compressed with no significant compression in motor fibers. ACTION: aggressive treatment and possible co-treatment with the primary care physician on a timely basis. GRADE 3: the back is very painful with paresthesia, constant numbness, weakness, and loss of reflex leg and/or foot, but no atrophy present. In grade 3 the sensory fibers are compressed and the motor fibers are mildly compressed. ACTION: aggressive treatment and referral on a semi-urgent basis to their physician or a spine specialist. GRADE 4: back is severely painful and/or numbness and/or paresthesia with inability to move some muscles. Muscle atrophy in buttock, hip, leg, and/or foot. In grade 4 there is major compression of sensory and motor fibers. ACTION: acupuncture treatment should not delay a semi-urgent referral to their physician or a neurosurgeon. An Acupuncturist's Guide to Medical Red Flags and Referrals, 2012, Anzaldua, pages 96-97",
      "exp_hant": "此警訊徵象為下背痛合併漸進性下肢麻木、刺痛及無力。腰神經根壓迫所致的壓迫性神經病變（神經根病變）應假定存在，直至排除為止。轉介的方式須視嚴重程度而定。第一級：背部輕度疼痛，臀部、髖部及／或腿部有間歇性感覺異常，下肢無感覺、運動或反射障礙；第一級無運動神經纖維壓迫，感覺神經纖維僅輕微受壓。處置：無需立即轉介。第二級：背部中度疼痛，臀部、腿部及／或足部有持續性感覺異常及客觀感覺喪失；第二級感覺神經纖維明顯受壓，運動神經纖維則無明顯受壓。處置：積極治療，並適時與主治醫師共同照護。第三級：背部劇烈疼痛，伴隨感覺異常、持續麻木、無力，以及腿部及／或足部反射喪失，但無肌肉萎縮；第三級感覺神經纖維受壓，運動神經纖維則輕度受壓。處置：積極治療，並半緊急轉介至其醫師或脊椎專科醫師。第四級：背部劇烈疼痛及／或麻木及／或感覺異常，並出現部分肌肉無法活動的情形，臀部、髖部、腿部及／或足部有肌肉萎縮；第四級感覺與運動神經纖維皆受到嚴重壓迫。處置：針灸治療不應延誤緊急轉介至其醫師或神經外科醫師的時機。《針灸師醫療警訊與轉介指南》，2012年，Anzaldua著，第96-97頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 319,
      "question_en": "You need to dispose of paper medical records after storing them for the required time according to your state regulations. Which of the following options are allowed?",
      "question_hant": "您需要在依照所屬州法規保存所需年限後，銷毀紙本病歷。下列哪些處理方式是被允許的？",
