          "key": "A",
          "en": "Vaginal cancer screening",
          "hant": "陰道癌篩檢",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Bladder cancer screening",
          "hant": "膀胱癌篩檢",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Cervical cancer screening",
          "hant": "子宮頸癌篩檢",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Uterine cancer screening",
          "hant": "子宮癌篩檢",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The pap smear is also known as the Papanicolaou test, the Pap test, cervical smear, or smear test. It is a screening test for cervical cancer. However, there is research to determine whether the test can also be used to detect ovarian and uterine cancer via DNA testing of the smear. In the Pap smear test cells are scraped from the opening of the cervix and then are analyzed under a microscope. Screening should start at age 21 (earlier if younger women are sexually active). After the first test it is recommended to have a Pap smear every 3 years. After the age of 30 if both the HPV (human papillomavirus) test and Pap smear are normal, then testing can be done every 5 years. HPV is the virus that causes genital warts and cervical cancer. The cells viewed in pap smears are classified on a scale of cellular changes from normal to cancerous. The smear is first identified as either normal or abnormal. If abnormal cells are identified, the doctor determines whether to repeat the Pap smear, test for HPV, or perform a colposcopy. Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests, 7th Edition, Pagana, page 702; 4th Edition, page 783",
      "exp_hant": "子宮頸抹片檢查又稱為帕氏檢查（Papanicolaou test）、Pap測試、子宮頸抹片或抹片檢查，是子宮頸癌的篩檢工具。然而，目前也有研究正探討是否可透過抹片的DNA檢測，來偵測卵巢癌與子宮癌。在子宮頸抹片檢查中，會從子宮頸開口刮取細胞，再置於顯微鏡下分析。建議自21歲起開始篩檢（若年輕女性較早有性行為則可提早開始）；首次檢查後建議每3年進行一次子宮頸抹片檢查；30歲以後，若人類乳突病毒（HPV）檢測與子宮頸抹片皆為正常，則可每5年檢查一次。HPV是引起菜花及子宮頸癌的病毒。抹片中所觀察到的細胞會依細胞變化程度分級，由正常至癌變不等，抹片首先會被判定為正常或異常；若發現異常細胞，醫師會決定是否重複抹片檢查、進行HPV檢測，或進行陰道鏡檢查。《Mosby診斷與檢驗手冊》第7版，Pagana著，第702頁；第4版，第783頁"
    },
