        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "bronchiolitis",
          "hant": "細支氣管炎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "epiglottitis",
          "hant": "會厭炎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "croup and bronchiolitis",
          "hant": "哮吼合併細支氣管炎",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Based on the history and symptoms, the most likely diagnosis is croup. The presence of inspiratory stridor (high pitched sound in inhaling), low grade fever, barking cough and the steeple sign in the x-ray all point to croup. In radiology, the steeple sign is found on the front of the neck where the trachea narrows and produces the shape of a church steeple within the trachea itself. The presence of the steeple sign supports a diagnosis of croup. In bronchiolitis the child usually appears toxic, the fever is very high (104 F or higher), and the child is extremely restless and anxious. Infants with bronchiolitis are more likely to have expiratory wheezing and rales instead of inspiratory stridor. Based on the symptoms, no lab tests are needed other than a chest x-ray. If a CBC were done it would be non-specific such as an elevated WBC. Arterial blood gas is not needed since the child is not in respiratory distress. Therapy consists of administering oxygen, monitoring heart rate, respiratory effort, and pulse oximetry. A single dose of the corticosteroid dexamethasone is administered. If no improvement is seen, the child should be sent to the emergency department for respiratory support. Antibiotics are not indicated. Croup occurs most of the time between the ages of 7 months and 36 months. Clinical Case Studies for the Family Nurse Practitioner, Leslie Neal-Boylan, 2011, page 45-47",
      "exp_hant": "根據病史與症狀，最可能的診斷為哮吼。吸氣性喘鳴（吸氣時的高音調聲響）、低度發燒、犬吠樣咳嗽，以及X光上的尖塔徵象，皆指向哮吼的診斷。在放射學上，尖塔徵象是指氣管前方因氣管本身變窄，而在氣管內形成類似教堂尖塔的形狀，尖塔徵象的出現支持哮吼的診斷。細支氣管炎患者通常看起來較為病重，發燒程度非常高（104°F以上），且患兒極度躁動不安；細支氣管炎的嬰兒較常出現吐氣性喘鳴及囉音，而非吸氣性喘鳴。根據目前症狀，除胸部X光外並不需要其他實驗室檢查；若進行全血球計數，結果通常也僅呈現非特異性的白血球升高。由於此嬰兒並無呼吸窘迫的情形，因此不需要進行動脈血氣分析。治療方式包括給予氧氣、監測心跳、呼吸用力程度及血氧濃度，並給予單一劑量的皮質類固醇dexamethasone（地塞米松）。若未見改善，應將嬰兒轉送急診接受呼吸支持治療，並不需要使用抗生素。哮吼多發生於7個月至36個月大的嬰幼兒。《家庭護理師臨床病例研究》，Leslie Neal-Boylan著，2011年，第45-47頁"
    },
