      "exp_en": "This is the best answer. It is the cardiac stress test which is done for heart stress testing. There are two carotid arteries, each located on the side of the neck. These two arteries transport blood from the heart to the brain. A carotid ultrasound is usually ordered to evaluate whether these arteries are blocked or narrowed. Narrowed or blocked carotid arteries can be due to a buildup of fat, cholesterol, calcium which end up lining and thickening the arterial walls (atherosclerosis). In such a situation it increases the risk of a stroke. This test can be ordered when the patient has TIAs (transient ischemic attacks), high blood presure, acute visual or speech problems, dizziness, syncope, or a family history of stroke or heart disease. Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests, 7th Edition, Pagana, page 840-841",
      "exp_hant": "此為最佳答案。心臟壓力測試才是用於心臟壓力測試的檢查。頸動脈共有兩條，分別位於頸部兩側，負責將血液從心臟運送至大腦。頸動脈超音波通常用於評估這些動脈是否阻塞或狹窄，動脈狹窄或阻塞可能是脂肪、膽固醇、鈣質沉積於動脈壁並使其增厚（動脈粥狀硬化）所造成，此情況會增加中風的風險。此檢查可於患者出現暫時性腦缺血發作（TIA）、高血壓、急性視力或言語問題、頭暈、暈厥，或有中風或心臟病家族病史時安排進行。《Mosby診斷與檢驗手冊》第7版，Pagana著，第840-841頁"
