      "question_en": "A 45 year-old female had sharp chest pain whenever she took a deep breath. Two days earlier she started to experience mild SOB. She had a history of both her ankles swelling and mild heart failure. Physical exam, showed a pulse of 90 bpm and regular rhythm. Blood pressure was 140/85. Respiration was unstable between 15-30 per minute. The patient was 5 feet 2 inches tall and weighed 170 pounds. Pitting edema was observed in her ankles, with the right ankle 4 cm larger than the left. Her lips have a slight bluish tint. She had SOB in the office. Which action would you take?",
      "question_hant": "一名45歲女性每次深呼吸時皆有銳利的胸痛。兩天前開始出現輕度呼吸急促，她有雙側踝部腫脹及輕度心臟衰竭的病史。理學檢查顯示脈搏每分鐘90次，節律規則；血壓140/85；呼吸速率不穩定，介於每分鐘15至30次之間。患者身高5呎2吋，體重170磅。雙側踝部可見凹陷性水腫，右踝比左踝大4公分。嘴唇略帶藍紫色，且在診間出現呼吸急促。您應採取下列何種處置？",
