      "number": 336,
      "question_en": "You have been treating a 47 year-old male patient for the past two years for general muscle pain with a medical diagnosis of chronic fatigue syndrome (CFS). You get a letter requesting that you attend a Worker's Compensation hearing regarding this patient who is claiming disability due to low back pain. You look over your medical notes. There were no entries specifically regarding treating lower back pain but pain in general. You are confident that by looking at your acupuncture point prescription (many of which included BL-23) you can reconstruct what is important for the Worker's Compensation hearing. What should you do?",
      "question_hant": "您過去兩年來一直為一名47歲的男性患者治療，其醫學診斷為慢性疲勞症候群（CFS），主訴為全身肌肉疼痛。您收到一封信，要求您出席一場工傷賠償聽證會，該患者主張因下背痛而致殘。您查閱自己的病歷紀錄，發現並無專門記載治療下背痛的紀錄，僅有全身性疼痛的紀錄。您相當確信，透過檢視自己開立的針灸處方（其中許多都包含腎俞），可以重建出工傷賠償聽證會所需的重要資訊。您應該怎麼做？",
