          "en": "Amend the medical record to include low back pain on the first treatment that needled BL-23. Date and sign. Get consent to release protected health information. Discuss with the patient that your testimony does not guarantee the outcome that they want.",
          "hant": "修改病歷，將首次針刺腎俞的治療紀錄加入下背痛的內容，並註明日期與簽名，取得患者同意以釋出個人健康資訊，並與患者討論您的證詞並不保證能達成他們所希望的結果",
