    {
      "number": 338,
      "question_en": "What is the percentage of individuals who commit suicide have a mental disorder at the time of their deaths?",
      "question_hant": "自殺身亡者中，死亡當下患有精神疾病的比例為多少？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "50 percent",
