    {
      "number": 341,
      "question_en": "Rosie is a 47 year-old teacher. She complains of weight gain from 135 to 165 in a one year period. She is not taking any medications. She has separated from her husband and lives alone. She says food comforts her and she drinks about a bottle of wine every night after work. She complains of constant thirst, drinking six big water bottles at school during the day. She says that she is tired and exhausted. Though not sexually active, she complains of vaginal irritation. She has blurry vision most of the time. She has no muscle weakness, headaches, or dizziness and is not bothered by cold weather. The physical exam is normal otherwise for her age. BP is normal as well as the pulse. There is no palpable thyroid gland. There is no edema. The neurological exam is normal EXCEPT for her DTRs which may be a little sluggish at 1+. Which tests are warranted?",
      "question_hant": "Rosie是一名47歲的教師，主訴一年內體重從135磅增加至165磅，目前未服用任何藥物。她與丈夫分居，獨自居住，表示食物能帶給她安慰感，且每晚下班後會喝約一瓶葡萄酒。她主訴持續口渴，白天在學校會喝六大瓶水。她表示感到疲倦且精疲力竭，雖無性行為，但主訴有陰道刺激感。她大多數時候視力模糊。無肌肉無力、頭痛或頭暈的情形，也不畏懼寒冷天氣。就其年齡而言，理學檢查其餘部分皆正常，血壓與脈搏亦正常，未觸及甲狀腺腫大，無水腫。神經學檢查除深部肌腱反射（DTR）略顯遲鈍（1+）外，其餘皆正常。應安排下列哪些檢查？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
