        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "CT of abdomen, Thyroid function studies, Fasting glucose, Glucose tolerance test",
          "hant": "腹部電腦斷層、甲狀腺功能檢查、空腹血糖、葡萄糖耐受試驗",
