      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. CT of abdomen is not needed. She has diabetes and hypothyroidism. Symptoms that point to possible diabetes include constant thirst and drinking six big water bottles per day. Symptoms that point to hypothyroidism include weight gain, fatigue, dizziness, headache, and blurred vision. She is most likely using alcohol abuse as self-medication for the depression arising from separating from her husband. Fasting glucose measures blood sugar levels after the patient has not eaten for at least 8 hours. The fasting glucose test is often the first test done on the patient to check for prediabetes and diabetes. The glucose tolerance test is done to diagnose diabetes type 2. The thyroid function test is a series of blood tests that measure thyroid gland function and evaluates levels of T3, T3RU (measures the level of proteins that carry thyroid hormone in the blood), T4, and TSH. Chemistry panels is a blood test that measures a variety of substances such as electrolytes, biluribin, triglycerides, creatinine, potassium, urea, calcium, chloride, etc. Chemistry panels have a number after them such as chem-18, which tells you that 18 different substances are being evaluated. The most complete chem screen panel is chem-20. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, page 299, 710",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且準確的答案。不需要進行腹部電腦斷層。她同時患有糖尿病與甲狀腺機能低下。可能提示糖尿病的症狀包括持續口渴及每日大量飲水（六大瓶）；可能提示甲狀腺機能低下的症狀則包括體重增加、疲勞、頭暈、頭痛及視力模糊。她很可能是以酒精作為自我治療的方式，用以緩解因與丈夫分居所引發的憂鬱情緒。空腹血糖檢測是在患者至少8小時未進食後測量其血糖濃度，通常是用於篩檢糖尿病前期及糖尿病的第一項檢查。葡萄糖耐受試驗則用於診斷第二型糖尿病。甲狀腺功能檢查是一系列血液檢查，用以測量甲狀腺功能，評估T3、T3RU（測量血液中攜帶甲狀腺荷爾蒙之蛋白質濃度）、T4及TSH的濃度。生化檢查是一種血液檢查，用以測量多種物質，如電解質、膽紅素、三酸甘油脂、肌酸酐、鉀、尿素、鈣、氯化物等。生化檢查會依所測項目數量標示，例如chem-18表示測量18種不同物質，而最完整的生化檢查為chem-20。《生醫學：針灸與東方醫學執業者教科書》，2007年，Robinson著，第299、710頁"
    },
