      "exp_en": "Zollinger-Ellison syndrome is a disorder where increased levels of the hormone gastrin are produced, causing the stomach to produce excess hydrochloric acid. Protonix (pantoprazole), a proton pump inhibitor, is used to treat conditions with excess stomach acid such as GERD and erosive esophagitis. tcmtests.com, July 2019",
