      "exp_en": "The correct answers are: Breast cyst: non-solid breast lumps that can occur in clusters, are round/elongated, mobile, tender, and well defined, and tends to occur in young adults. Fibroadenoma: breast lumps that are non-tender, mobile, round/elongated, smooth and well defined, and tends to occur in young adults. Fibrocystic breast: diffused breast lumps that are tender, can be bilateral, with nipple discharge, and fluctuate in size with menstrual cycle. Breast cancer: irregular shaped breast lumps, fixed, undefined, non-tender, with possible skin changes, and tends to occur &gt; 50 years old. Fibroadenoma lumps are non-tender. Fibrocystic breast lumps and breast cysts are usually tender. Fibroadenoma and breast cancer have non-tender lumps. Breast cysts are fluid filled and a non-solid mass whereas fibrocystic breast, Fibroadenoma, and breast cancer have a solid mass. Breast cysts and Fibroadenoma have lumps that are round or elongated, smooth and well defined. Fibrocystic breast lumps are more diffuse and can be bilateral. Breast cancer lumps have an irregular shape and difficult to define. Breast cysts, Fibroadenoma, and fibrocystic breast have mobile lumps whereas in breast cancer the lump is fixed. Differential Diagnosis, Rhoads, 2015 page 20-24",
      "exp_hant": "正確答案為：乳房囊腫：非實質性、可群聚出現、圓形/橢圓形、可移動、有觸痛且邊界清楚的乳房腫塊，好發於年輕成人。纖維腺瘤：無觸痛、可移動、圓形/橢圓形、光滑且邊界清楚的乳房腫塊，好發於年輕成人。纖維囊性乳房：瀰漫性、觸痛、可雙側發生、伴隨乳頭分泌物，且大小隨月經週期波動的乳房腫塊。乳癌：形狀不規則、固定、邊界不清、無觸痛，可能伴隨皮膚變化，且好發於50歲以上者。纖維腺瘤的腫塊無觸痛。纖維囊性乳房腫塊與乳房囊腫通常有觸痛。纖維腺瘤與乳癌的腫塊則無觸痛。乳房囊腫是充滿液體的非實質性腫塊，而纖維囊性乳房、纖維腺瘤與乳癌則為實質性腫塊。乳房囊腫與纖維腺瘤的腫塊呈圓形或橢圓形、光滑且邊界清楚。纖維囊性乳房腫塊則較為瀰漫且可雙側發生。乳癌腫塊形狀不規則且難以界定。乳房囊腫、纖維腺瘤與纖維囊性乳房的腫塊可移動，而乳癌的腫塊則是固定的。《鑑別診斷》，Rhoads著，2015年，第20-24頁"
