      "exp_en": "A varus force is force applied on the inside of the knee, pushing out away from the body. The Adduction stress test evaluates the lateral collateral ligament (LCL) of the knee. Pain in the gap in the lateral joint line indicates that the ligaments are lax and that there can be a partial tear of the LCL. LCL sprains are classified into grade 1, grade 2 or grade 3. In grade 1, symptoms include tenderness on palpation over the ligament, on the outside of the knee. There is little or no swelling. During the test there is pain but there is no joint laxity. In grade 2, there is significant pain over the ligament on the outside of the knee. There is some swelling over the ligament. When the knee is stressed via a varus force in the test, there is pain and some laxity in the joint. In grade 3, there is a complete tear in the lateral ligament. Pain can vary but can be actually less than a grade 2. When the varus force is applied there is significant joint laxity. In grade 1 and 2 conservative treatments are applied (NSAIDs, physical therapy, ultrasound, etc.). In grade 3 surgery may be needed. After an injury, treatment involves applying the PRICE therapy (Protection, Rest, Ice, Compression, Elevation), for at least the first 72 hours or until a specialist does an evaluation. Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 13th Edition, page 807-809; Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 10th Edition, page 632-634",
      "exp_hant": "內翻力是施加於膝關節內側、將其向外推離身體的力量。內收應力測試用於評估膝關節外側副韌帶（LCL）。若外側關節間隙出現疼痛，表示韌帶鬆弛，可能有LCL部分撕裂。LCL扭傷分為第一級、第二級或第三級。第一級：症狀包括韌帶觸診時（膝關節外側）有壓痛，幾乎無腫脹；測試時有疼痛但無關節鬆弛。第二級：韌帶處（膝關節外側）有明顯疼痛，並有些微腫脹；測試時以內翻力施壓膝關節時，會出現疼痛及些微關節鬆弛。第三級：外側韌帶完全撕裂，疼痛程度可能因人而異，甚至可能低於第二級；施加內翻力時關節有明顯鬆弛。第一級與第二級採保守治療（如非類固醇消炎藥、物理治療、超音波治療等），第三級可能需要手術。受傷後的治療包括PRICE療法（保護、休息、冰敷、加壓、抬高），至少應持續前72小時，或直到專科醫師完成評估為止。《貝茲身體檢查指南》第13版，第807-809頁；第10版，第632-634頁"
