      ],
      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. The most likely diagnsosis is cirrhosis of the liver due to excesssive alcohol drinking and postural hypotension. The creatinine test monitors kidney function. Liver profile studies measure blood levels of total protein, albumin, bilirubin, and liver enzymes. High or low levels can indicate liver damage or that liver disease is present. A CBC (Complete Blood Count) is a blood test that evaluates overall health to help detect a wide number of disorders (anemia, leukemia, infection, etc). A CBC measures several blood components that includes red blood cells (RBCs) that carry oxygen. A lipid profile or lipid panel is series of blood tests are an initial broad medical screening tool for abnormalities in lipids (cholesterol, triglycerides, etc.). ECG is to evaluate the electrical activity of the heart to help assess the postural hypotension. A chem panel is a blood test to evaluate the electrolyte balance and/or the status of several major body organs. Cirrhosis is a late stage fibrosis (scarring) of the liver. Cirrhosis is caused by different types of liver diseases (hepatitis, fatty liver) and conditions (chronic alcoholism). The scarring eventually prevents the liver from properly functioning. The scar tissue blocks liver blood flow and slows down its processing of hormones, nutrients, drugs, and naturally produced body toxins. Symptoms of cirrhosis include poor appetite, fatigue, weight loss or sudden weight gain, bruises, jaundice, itchy skin, edema (ankles, legs, abdomen), urine with an orange tint, light colored stools, blood in stool, confusion, and personality changes. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, pages 695, 715",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且準確的答案。最可能的診斷為因過量飲酒導致的肝硬化，以及姿勢性低血壓。肌酸酐檢測用於監測腎功能。肝功能檢查測量血中總蛋白、白蛋白、膽紅素及肝酵素濃度，數值過高或過低可能顯示肝損傷或肝病存在。全血球計數（CBC）是一種評估整體健康狀況，有助於檢測多種疾病（貧血、白血病、感染等）的血液檢測。CBC測量多項血液成分，包括負責攜帶氧氣的紅血球（RBC）。血脂檢查或血脂圖是一系列血液檢測，作為評估血脂異常（膽固醇、三酸甘油酯等）的初步廣泛篩檢工具。心電圖用於評估心臟電活動，有助於評估姿勢性低血壓。生化檢查是用於評估電解質平衡及／或多項主要器官狀態的血液檢測。肝硬化是肝臟晚期纖維化（結疤）的表現，可由不同類型的肝病（肝炎、脂肪肝）及狀況（慢性酒精中毒）引起。結疤最終會妨礙肝臟正常運作，疤痕組織阻塞肝臟血流，並減緩其對荷爾蒙、營養素、藥物及體內自然產生毒素的處理。肝硬化的症狀包括食慾不振、疲勞、體重減輕或突然增加、瘀傷、黃疸、皮膚搔癢、水腫（腳踝、腿部、腹部）、尿液呈橙色、糞便顏色變淺、糞便帶血、意識混亂及性格改變。《生物醫學：針灸與東方醫學執業者教科書》，2007年，Robinson著，第695、715頁"
