      "exp_en": "The sum of the chemical reactions that take place within each cell. The chemical reactions are divided into anabolic and catabolic reactions. An anabolic reaction builds new molecules and/or stores energy. A catabolic reactions breaks down molecules or stored energy. The energy that is created from a catabolic reaction is what is used by the body to drive all anabolic reactions. Metabolism can be seen as a process of converting food into the energy. Individuals with a fast metabolism use up calories more quickly than those with a slow metabolism. Exercising is one way to can increase metabolism. Oxidation is the chemical combination of a substance with oxygen. tcmtests.com, January 2020",
      "exp_hant": "代謝是指每個細胞內發生的化學反應總和，這些化學反應分為合成代謝反應與分解代謝反應。合成代謝反應會建構新分子並／或儲存能量，分解代謝反應則會分解分子或釋放儲存的能量。由分解代謝反應所產生的能量，即為身體驅動所有合成代謝反應所使用的能量。代謝可視為將食物轉換為能量的過程。新陳代謝快的人比新陳代謝慢的人消耗熱量更快，運動是提升代謝的方法之一。氧化作用是指物質與氧氣的化學結合。tcmtests.com，2020年1月"
