        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "up to 50 percent",
          "hant": "最高50%",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Sleep is divided into cycles of REM (rapid eye movement) dream phase and NREM (non-rapid eye movement) non-dream phases. In an adult, NREM constitutes 75-80% of total sleep time and REM sleep accounts for 20-25% of total sleep time. Babies can spend up to 50% of their sleep in the REM stage. NREM sleep has three stages (some sources say there are four) of increasing depth of sleep. Progression through the stages occur cyclically 4-5 times throughout the night. Brain waves progressively become slower through the stages of NREM sleep. Stage 1: eyes are closed and it is easy to be awakened. Stage 2: this is the stage of light sleep where the heart rate slows and body temperature drops. At this stage the body is preparing for deep sleep. Stage 3: this is the deep sleep stage. In this stage, it is more difficult to be awakened. If awakened during this stage there is disorientation for a few minutes. During NREM sleep the the body repairs itself, regrows tissues, and strengthens the immune system. REM sleep following each cycle of NREM sleep. During REM sleep is the period of dreaming. Normally, REM sleep occurs 90 minutes after sleep onset. The first period of REM sleep lasts about 10 minutes. Later stages of REM sleep stages get longer with the last stage lasting up to one hour. Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page 1835; www.webmd.com/sleep-disorders/sleep-101",
      "exp_hant": "睡眠可分為快速動眼期（REM，作夢階段）與非快速動眼期（NREM，非作夢階段）的循環。成人的NREM約占總睡眠時間的75-80%，REM睡眠約占總睡眠時間的20-25%。嬰兒的REM睡眠可占其睡眠時間的最高50%。NREM睡眠有三個階段（部分資料指出有四個階段），睡眠深度逐漸加深，整晚會循環進行4-5次，腦波在NREM睡眠各階段中逐漸變慢。第一階段：眼睛閉合，容易被喚醒。第二階段：這是輕度睡眠階段，心跳減慢、體溫下降，身體正為深度睡眠做準備。第三階段：這是深度睡眠階段，此階段較難被喚醒，若於此階段被喚醒，會有幾分鐘的定向力障礙。在NREM睡眠期間，身體會自我修復、重新生長組織並強化免疫系統。每個NREM睡眠週期之後接續REM睡眠，REM睡眠期間即為作夢的時段。一般而言，REM睡眠會在入睡後90分鐘出現，第一段REM睡眠約持續10分鐘，之後的REM睡眠階段會逐漸拉長，最後一段可長達一小時。《默克診療手冊》第18版，第1835頁；www.webmd.com/sleep-disorders/sleep-101"
    },
