      ],
      "exp_en": "The endometrium is the inner epithelial layer, along with its mucous membrane, of the uterus. To enable menstrual blood to flow freely from the uterus and leave the body without clotting, the uterus produces an anti-clotting agent called plasmin. However, when menstrual loss is heavy, the anti-clotting agent may not be adequate for the menstrual period and the blood is likely to form clots. Also, if menstrual blood accumulates faster than the ability to transfer it out of the uterus, clots can also result. Lysozyme is a protein found in tears, saliva, and other secretions. Catalase is an enzyme that catalyzes the decomposition of hydrogen peroxide in cells. Carbonic anhydrase is a protein that helps regulate the acid-base balance and pH in blood. tcmtests.com, September 2020",
      "exp_hant": "子宮內膜是子宮內層的上皮組織，連同其黏膜層。為使經血能順利從子宮流出並排出體外而不凝結，子宮會分泌一種稱為纖維蛋白溶酶（plasmin）的抗凝血物質。然而，當經血量過多時，此抗凝血物質可能不足以應付整個經期，血液便容易形成血塊；此外，若經血累積速度快於其排出子宮的能力，也可能形成血塊。溶菌酶是一種存在於淚液、唾液及其他分泌物中的蛋白質。過氧化氫酶是一種能催化細胞內過氧化氫分解的酵素。碳酸酐酶是一種有助於調節血液酸鹼平衡與pH值的蛋白質。tcmtests.com，2020年9月"
    },
    {
      "number": 419,
      "question_en": "Edward is a 67-year-old building inspector. He complains of repeated falls. He is being treated for high blood pressure with a diuretic and alpha blocker. He reports that he drinks 5-6 shots of tequila every night and has been doing so for four years. The physical examination shows a BP of 140/88 in both arms while lying down and 115/80 when standing. He reports that he feels dizzy when he stands up but quickly clears away. There is a liver edge 3 FBs down which is tender. There is normal liver percussion. There are no ascites or telangiectases or other signs of liver failure. The neurological exam is normal. What is the underlying diagnosis of ALL the symptoms and signs?",
      "question_hant": "Edward是一名67歲的建築檢查員，主訴反覆跌倒。他因高血壓正接受利尿劑與甲型阻斷劑治療，並表示他每晚飲用5-6份龍舌蘭酒，且已持續四年。理學檢查顯示，平躺時雙臂血壓為140/88，站立時為115/80，他表示站立時會感到頭暈，但很快就會消失。肝臟邊緣可觸及至肋緣下3指幅，並有壓痛，肝臟叩診正常，無腹水、蜘蛛痣或其他肝衰竭徵象，神經學檢查正常。以上所有症狀與徵象的根本診斷為何？",
