      "exp_en": "He most likely has cirrhosis of the liver. Cirrhosis is a late stage fibrosis (scarring) of the liver. Cirrhosis is caused by different types of liver diseases (hepatitis, fatty liver) and conditions (chronic alcoholism). The scarring eventually prevents the liver from properly functioning properly. The scar tissue blocks liver blood flow and slows down its processing of hormones, nutrients, drugs, and naturally produced body toxins. Symptoms of cirrhosis include poor appetite, fatigue, weight loss or sudden weight gain, bruises, jaundice, itchy skin, edema (ankles, legs, abdomen), urine with an orange tint, light colored stools, blood in stool, confusion, and personality changes. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, pages 695, 715",
      "exp_hant": "他最有可能罹患肝硬化。肝硬化是肝臟晚期纖維化（結疤）的表現，可由不同類型的肝病（肝炎、脂肪肝）及狀況（慢性酒精中毒）引起，結疤最終會妨礙肝臟正常運作，疤痕組織阻塞肝臟血流，並減緩其對荷爾蒙、營養素、藥物及體內自然產生毒素的處理。肝硬化的症狀包括食慾不振、疲勞、體重減輕或突然增加、瘀傷、黃疸、皮膚搔癢、水腫（腳踝、腿部、腹部）、尿液呈橙色、糞便顏色變淺、糞便帶血、意識混亂及性格改變。《生物醫學：針灸與東方醫學執業者教科書》，2007年，Robinson著，第695、715頁"
    },
