      "exp_en": "This is a red flag case. Acute pericarditis is an inflammation of the pericardium. It has a sudden onset, is often painful, and causes fluid and blood cells to enter the pericardial space. Acute pericarditis is the result of an infection or other conditions that irritate the pericardium. Acute pericarditis usually causes fever and sharp chest pain that often extends to the left shoulder and down the left arm. The chest pain is like that of a heart attack, except that the pain is worse lying down, swallowing food, coughing, or deep breathing. The chest pain in acute pericarditis almost always there. The pain is sharp, behind the sternum, and radiates to the back and left shoulder. There can be fatigue or shortness of breath with exertion. This patient has acute pericarditis with pericardial fluid compressing the heart and preventing normal heart beats. This is a red flag case. This patient has an acute disease and cardiomyopathy is a chronic disease of the heart muscle. CHF (congestive heart failure) is a chronic disease arising from a weak pumping heart with SOB, weight gain, fatigue, edema, and difficulty breathing while lying flat. Acute pneumonia is a bacterial or viral lung infection. Common symptoms are sore throat, fever with chill, breathing difficulty, flushed cheeks, coughing, wheezing, chest pain, cyanosis, and profuse sweating. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, pages 643, 714",
      "exp_hant": "這是一個紅旗警示病例。急性心包炎是心包膜的發炎，發病突然，常伴隨疼痛，並導致液體及血球細胞進入心包腔。急性心包炎是感染或其他刺激心包膜的病症所引起。急性心包炎通常引起發燒及銳利胸痛，疼痛常延伸至左肩及左臂。此胸痛類似心臟病發作，但平躺、吞嚥食物、咳嗽或深呼吸時疼痛會加劇。急性心包炎的胸痛幾乎持續存在，疼痛呈銳利狀，位於胸骨後方，並放射至背部及左肩。運動時可能出現疲勞或呼吸急促。此患者為急性心包炎，心包積液壓迫心臟，妨礙正常心跳。這是一個紅旗警示病例。此患者為急性病症，而心肌病變是一種慢性心肌疾病。CHF（充血性心衰竭）是一種因心臟幫浦功能減弱所致的慢性疾病，伴有呼吸急促、體重增加、疲勞、水腫及平躺呼吸困難。急性肺炎是細菌或病毒引起的肺部感染，常見症狀包括喉嚨痛、發燒伴寒顫、呼吸困難、臉頰潮紅、咳嗽、喘鳴、胸痛、發紺及大量出汗。《Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine》，2007年，Robinson著，第643、714頁"
    },
