      "exp_en": "The recommendation is that self-examination start at 15 years old and be done monthly. The current guidelines from the American Cancer Society is to do testicular examination as part of the general physical exam. The ACS does not have a recommendation for regular self-examination. Most testicular cancers can be found at an early stage, when they are small and have not spread. In some men, early testicular cancers cause symptoms that lead them to seek medical attention. Most of the time a lump on the testicle is the first symptom, or the testicle might be swollen or larger than normal. But some testicular cancers might not cause symptoms until they have reached an advanced stage. Most often, the first symptom of testicular cancer is a lump on the testicle, or the testicle becomes swollen or larger (it is normal for one testicle to be slightly larger than the other, and for one to hang lower than the other.) Some testicular tumors might cause pain, but most of the time they do not. Men with testicular cancer can also have a feeling of heaviness or aching in the lower belly (abdomen) or scrotum. Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 13th Edition, page 689; Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 10th Edition, page 507",
      "exp_hant": "建議自15歲開始進行自我檢查，並每月一次。美國癌症協會（ACS）目前的指引是將睪丸檢查納入一般身體檢查的一部分，ACS並未針對定期自我檢查提出建議。大多數睪丸癌可在早期被發現，當時腫瘤仍小且尚未擴散。部分男性早期睪丸癌會出現症狀而促使就醫，多數情況下，睪丸出現腫塊是第一個症狀，或睪丸可能腫脹或比正常大。但有些睪丸癌可能直到進展到晚期才出現症狀。最常見的是睪丸出現腫塊，或睪丸腫脹變大（一側睪丸略大於另一側、一側略低於另一側屬正常現象）。部分睪丸腫瘤可能引起疼痛，但多數情況下不會。患有睪丸癌的男性也可能感到下腹部或陰囊有沉重或痠痛感。《Bate's Guide to Physical Examination》，第13版，第689頁；第10版，第507頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 428,
      "question_en": "The Pregnanediol Urine test is ordered for",
      "question_hant": "孕二醇尿液檢測（Pregnanediol Urine test）適用於下列哪些情況？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Pelvic inflammatory disease, Female infertility, History of miscarriages",
          "hant": "骨盆腔發炎疾病、女性不孕、流產病史",
