          "key": "B",
          "en": "Pelvic inflammatory disease, High risk pregnancy, History of miscarriages",
          "hant": "骨盆腔發炎疾病、高風險妊娠、流產病史",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "High risk pregnancy, Female infertility, History of miscarriages",
          "hant": "高風險妊娠、女性不孕、流產病史",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "High risk pregnancy, Female infertility, History of miscarriages, Pelvic inflammatory disease",
          "hant": "高風險妊娠、女性不孕、流產病史、骨盆腔發炎疾病",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is the most accurate answer. The test is not used with PID (pelvic inflammatory disease). Pregnanediol is an inactive metabolic by-product of progesterone. The measurement of pregnanediol in the urine is an indirect way of measuring progesterone levels. The hormone progesterone is vital for normal menstruation and fertility. The release of the egg by the ovaries is associated with high levels of pregnanediol. Because the placenta releases pregnanediol, it is measured during pregnancy in women who have a history of miscarriages, premature delivery, and in women with difficult pregnancies. Low levels of pregnanediol are also observed in preeclampsia. Women treated for infertility also have their levels measured to evaluate sufficient progesterone levels. Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests, 7th Edition, Pagana, page 911; 4th Edition page 987",
      "exp_hant": "此為最準確的答案。此檢測不用於PID（骨盆腔發炎疾病）。孕二醇是黃體素的一種無活性代謝副產物，測量尿液中的孕二醇是間接測量黃體素濃度的方式。黃體素這種荷爾蒙對正常月經與生育力至關重要，卵巢排卵與高濃度孕二醇有關。由於胎盤會釋放孕二醇，因此在有流產病史、早產或妊娠困難的孕婦中會進行此項測量。子癇前症患者的孕二醇濃度也偏低。接受不孕治療的女性也會測量此數值，以評估黃體素是否充足。《Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests》，第7版，Pagana著，第911頁；第4版，第987頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 429,
      "question_en": "How does Pelvic Inflammatory Disease (PID) cause infertility?",
      "question_hant": "骨盆腔發炎疾病（PID）如何導致不孕？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "the inflammation prevents the egg from implanting in the uterus",
          "hant": "發炎阻止卵子著床於子宮",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "scar tissue in the fallopian tubes prevents fertilization",
          "hant": "輸卵管中的疤痕組織阻止受精",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "PID prevents the hypothalamus from releasing GnRH (gonadotropin-releasing hormone)",
          "hant": "PID阻止下視丘釋放GnRH（促性腺激素釋放激素）",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "the uterus becomes too acidic for the sperm to survive",
          "hant": "子宮變得過於酸性，使精子無法存活",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "PID is an infection of upper female reproductive system (uterus, fallopian tubes, ovaries) that can cause infertility. PID usually develops from a bacterial infection in the vagina or cervix. Common bacteria associated with PID are neisseria gonorrhea and chlamydia trachomatis. Other bacterial infections can arise from surgery, abortion, or vaginal birth. Sexually active females with multiple partners are at most risk of PID. The infection causes an inflammation of the mucosal layer of the vagina . This can cause a change in the bacterial flora of the vagina, also called bacterial vaginosis. The infection can travel up the vagina, through the cervix, into the uterus, and into the fallopian tubes. and ovaries. PID is problematic when it reaches the fallopian tubes (salpingitis) or the ovaries (salpingo-oopharitis). The infection triggers an immune response that eventually damages the tubal epitheleum. The fallopian tubes become filled with pus. If pus builds up in the fallopian tube it can turn into an abscess which can be life-threating if it ruptures. If watery fluid fills up in the pockets created by scar tissue it can cause the affected area to become swollen. Scar tissue begins forming which then creates closed-off pockets and pouches in the fallopian tube. The scar tissue blocks ovulation and fertilization. PID creates structural damage to the fallopian tubes causing infertility, a higher risk of an ectopic pregnancy, and chronic pelvic pain Some women will have few or no symptoms of PID. When there are noticeable symptoms they includes pelvic pain, tenderness around the ovaries and fallopian tubes, fever and abnormal vaginal discharges. Diagnosis is based on physical findings especially pelvic pain and cervical motion tenderness. Cervical motion tenderness occurs when the mobilization of the cervix during a vaginal exam causes pain and tenderness in the upper right quadrant of the abdomen. There are no specific tests for PID but there are some tests that can support the diagnosis such as testing vaginal discharges for signs of bacterial infection, nucleic acid amplification detects chlamydia and gonorrhea DNA in a sample taken from the vagina, and ultrasound can show fluid in the fallopian tubes. Treatment consists of a mix of antibiotics usually injection of cefriaxone and cefotetan, and acetaminophen can be given to manage the pain. Occasionally surgery is needed to remove adhesion/scar tissue that can be causing the pain. tcmtests.com, July 2020",
      "exp_hant": "PID是女性上生殖系統（子宮、輸卵管、卵巢）的感染，可導致不孕。PID通常由陰道或子宮頸的細菌感染發展而來，常見相關細菌為淋病奈瑟氏菌及砂眼披衣菌。其他細菌感染可能源自手術、流產或陰道生產。多重性伴侶且性生活活躍的女性罹患PID的風險最高。此感染會造成陰道黏膜層發炎，這可能改變陰道的菌叢生態，即所謂的細菌性陰道炎。感染可沿陰道向上蔓延，經子宮頸進入子宮，再進入輸卵管及卵巢。當PID蔓延至輸卵管（輸卵管炎）或卵巢（輸卵管卵巢炎）時問題較為嚴重。感染引發免疫反應，最終損害輸卵管上皮，輸卵管會充滿膿液。若膿液在輸卵管中堆積，可能形成膿瘍，若破裂則可能危及生命。若水樣液體填滿疤痕組織所形成的囊袋，可能使患部腫脹。疤痕組織開始形成，在輸卵管中造成封閉的囊袋與腔室，疤痕組織會阻礙排卵與受精。PID對輸卵管造成結構性損傷，導致不孕、子宮外孕風險增加及慢性骨盆腔疼痛。部分女性PID症狀輕微或無症狀，若有明顯症狀，包括骨盆腔疼痛、卵巢及輸卵管周圍壓痛、發燒及異常陰道分泌物。診斷主要依據身體檢查所見，尤其是骨盆腔疼痛及子宮頸搖擺痛。子宮頸搖擺痛是指陰道檢查時移動子宮頸會引起腹部右上象限的疼痛與壓痛。目前尚無專屬PID的檢測，但有些檢測可支持診斷，例如檢測陰道分泌物是否有細菌感染跡象、核酸擴增法可偵測陰道採樣中的披衣菌及淋病DNA，以及超音波可顯示輸卵管內的積液。治療通常合併使用抗生素，常為注射頭孢曲松（cefriaxone）及頭孢替坦（cefotetan），並可給予乙醯胺酚（acetaminophen）以緩解疼痛。偶爾需要手術移除可能引起疼痛的沾黏／疤痕組織。tcmtests.com，2020年7月"
    },
    {
      "number": 430,
      "question_en": "Sleep apnea is the cessation of breathing for",
      "question_hant": "睡眠呼吸中止症是指呼吸停止達多久？",
      "image": null,
