      "exp_en": "An apnea is the complete cessation of breathing for 10 or more seconds. A hypopnea is a constricted breath that lasts 10 seconds or longer. The main types of sleep apnea are: 1) Obstructive sleep apnea, the more common form that occurs when throat muscles relax. 2) Central sleep apnea, which occurs when the brain fails sending nerve signals to the muscles that control breathing. 3) Complex sleep apnea syndrome: this occurs when someone has both obstructive sleep apnea and central sleep apnea. Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests, 7th Edition, Pagana, page 1107; 4th Edition, page 1183",
      "exp_hant": "呼吸中止（apnea）是指呼吸完全停止達10秒或以上。低通氣（hypopnea）是指呼吸受限持續10秒或以上。睡眠呼吸中止症主要類型為：1）阻塞性睡眠呼吸中止症，較常見，發生於喉部肌肉放鬆時。2）中樞性睡眠呼吸中止症，發生於腦部未能將神經訊號傳送至控制呼吸的肌肉時。3）複合型睡眠呼吸中止症候群：發生於同時患有阻塞性及中樞性睡眠呼吸中止症時。《Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests》，第7版，Pagana著，第1107頁；第4版，第1183頁"
