        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Anemias caused by a vitamin B12 or folic acid deficiency are called megaloblastic anemias. Vitamin B12 cannot be produced by the human body and must be supplied by the diet. Anemias develop slowly and symptoms can be produced when the anemia has become severe. Pernicious anemia can be caused by a lack of gastric cells which secrete an intrinsic factor, an essential protein for absorbing the vitamin B12. B12 deficiency can produce neurological symptoms, poor mental functioning, numbness-tingling, sore tongue, fatigue, depression. A sore tongue that has a red, beefy appearance can be a symptom of B12 deficiency. The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page 1045",
      "exp_hant": "由維生素B12或葉酸缺乏所引起的貧血稱為巨胚紅血球性貧血。維生素B12無法由人體自行製造，必須由飲食提供。貧血發展緩慢，症狀通常在貧血變得嚴重時才會出現。惡性貧血可能由胃壁細胞缺乏所致，這些細胞分泌一種名為內在因子的物質，是吸收維生素B12所必需的蛋白質。B12缺乏可引起神經學症狀、心智功能不佳、麻木刺痛、舌頭疼痛及疲勞、憂鬱。舌頭疼痛且呈鮮紅、牛肉狀外觀，可能是B12缺乏的症狀。《The Merck Manual》，第18版，第1045頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 438,
      "question_en": "A 27 year-old female patient presents with the chief complaint of diarrhea and abdominal bloating which has worsened during the past three months. She reports a long history of non-specific gastrointestinal issues. She has bloating, nausea, an inconsistent bowel movement pattern with a tendency toward loose stools. During the past two months more than 60% of her bowel movements have been loose. She has recently been voiding two times per day. Her generalized abdominal bloating has been worsening in frequency and intensity, now manifesting 3-5 per week. She has vomiting every week for the past three weeks. She denies self inducing vomiting. She reports having a weight loss of nine pounds over a period of two months. She denies having traveled outside the country. Last year routine blood tests showed borderline iron deficiency anemia. Lab tests results: Hemoglobin 11.7; HCT 32; MCV 80; Ferritin: 75. The anti-tTG antibody and the IgA antibody is positive. What is the most likely diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一名27歲女性病患主訴腹瀉及腹脹，過去三個月症狀加劇。她長期有非特異性腸胃問題病史，出現腹脹、噁心、排便型態不穩定，且傾向於稀便。過去兩個月中，超過60%的排便為稀便。她近來每天排尿兩次。她的全身性腹脹症狀頻率與強度持續加重，目前每週出現3-5次。過去三週她每週皆有嘔吐，她否認自行催吐。她主訴兩個月內體重減輕九磅。她否認曾出國旅行。去年例行血液檢查顯示邊緣性缺鐵性貧血。實驗室檢查結果：血紅素11.7；血比容（HCT）32；平均紅血球體積（MCV）80；鐵蛋白：75。抗組織轉麩醯胺酸酶抗體（anti-tTG）及IgA抗體皆為陽性。最可能的診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Celiac disease",
          "hant": "乳糜瀉",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Ulcerative colitis",
          "hant": "潰瘍性結腸炎",
