      "exp_en": "In spondylolisthesis one vertebra slips forward compared to the next vertebra. Spondylolisthesis can lead to spinal deformity as narrowing of the spinal canal (central spinal stenosis) or compression of the exiting nerve roots (foraminal stenosis). Spondylolisthesis can be caused by a congenital defect, vertebral degeneration due to arthritis, spinal trauma, or by bone defects. Spondylolisthesis often occurs in young adult athletes with minimal trauma due to weak lumbar vertebrae. Spontaneous spondylolisthesis can also occur with minimal trauma in older patients (&gt;60 years old) who also have underlying arthritic changes. Spondylolisthesis can have sciatic leg pain symptoms when the displaced vertebrae impinge on nerve roots. In rare cases, spondylolisthesis can lead to loss of bladder and bowel control. Spondylolisthesis is easily diagnosed with lateral X-ray (from the side) which will show that one of the vertebra has slipped forward or backward compared to nearby vertebrae. Spondylolisthesis is graded according to the percentage of slip of the vertebra. Conservative treatment consists of rest, anti-inflammatories, cortisone, and back braces. Surgery could be considered for patients who fail to improve. The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page 329",
      "exp_hant": "脊椎滑脫症是指一節椎體相對於相鄰椎體向前滑移。脊椎滑脫症可導致脊椎變形，如椎管狹窄（中央型脊椎狹窄症）或出口神經根受壓（椎間孔狹窄症）。脊椎滑脫症可由先天性缺陷、關節炎引起的椎體退化、脊椎外傷或骨骼缺陷所致。脊椎滑脫症常見於年輕成年運動員，即使僅有輕微外傷，因其腰椎較為薄弱。年長患者（60歲以上）若合併潛在關節炎性病變，也可能在輕微外傷下發生自發性脊椎滑脫症。當移位的椎體壓迫神經根時，脊椎滑脫症可產生類似坐骨神經痛的腿部症狀。在罕見情況下，脊椎滑脫症可導致膀胱及腸道控制力喪失。脊椎滑脫症可藉由側位X光（從側面拍攝）輕易診斷，可顯示某節椎體相對鄰近椎體向前或向後滑移。脊椎滑脫症依椎體滑移的百分比分級。保守治療包括休息、抗發炎藥物、皮質類固醇及背架。若治療無改善，可考慮手術。《The Merck Manual》，第18版，第329頁"
