      "exp_en": "There is no such test as a Blood smear count but there is a blood smear test which is part of the CBC test. The blood smear test looks at a thin film of blood examined under a microscope. This test looks for abnormal shapes of cells that automated testing machines cannot detect. Healthy and mature RBCs are uniform in size, do not have a nucleus as most other cells do, and are round and flat like a donut. In sickle cell anemia, for example, the blood smear test can detect the sickle cell shape. Red blood cells (RBCs) carry oxygen. White blood cells (WBCs) fight infection. Hemoglobin is the oxygen-carrying protein in RBCs. Hematocrit is the proportion of RBCs to the fluid component(plasma) in the blood. Platelets are involved with blood clotting.",
      "exp_hant": "並沒有所謂的「血液抹片計數」這項檢測，但有血液抹片檢查，是CBC檢測的一部分。血液抹片檢查是在顯微鏡下觀察一薄層血液，用於尋找自動化檢測機器無法偵測到的異常細胞形狀。健康且成熟的紅血球大小均一，不像大多數其他細胞那樣具有細胞核，形狀呈圓形扁平如甜甜圈狀。例如在鐮刀型貧血中，血液抹片檢查可偵測出鐮刀狀的細胞形態。紅血球（RBC）負責攜帶氧氣，白血球（WBC）負責對抗感染。血紅素是紅血球中攜帶氧氣的蛋白質。血比容是紅血球佔血液中液體成分（血漿）的比例。血小板則參與血液凝固。"
