      "number": 462,
      "question_en": "On percussing the chest which of the following sounds is indicative of pneumothorax?",
      "question_hant": "叩診胸部時，何種聲音提示氣胸？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "a resonant sound",
          "hant": "共鳴音",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "a flat sound",
          "hant": "濁音",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
