      "question_en": "In assessing the active ROM (range of motion) of the right hip with a goniometer the patient flexes the hip with the knee bent. The ROM reading is taken when",
      "question_hant": "以量角器評估右髖主動關節活動度（ROM）時，病患屈曲髖關節並彎曲膝蓋。ROM讀數應於何時記錄？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
