          "en": "the left anterior superior iliac spine begins to move",
          "hant": "左側髂前上棘開始移動時",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "the lower spine is flat on the examining table",
          "hant": "下段脊椎平貼於檢查台時",
          "correct": false
