      "exp_en": "The four insurance codes 97810, 97811, 97813, and 97814 all relate to acupuncture procedures, but they each cover different aspects of the treatment. 97810: Acupuncture, initial 15 minutes. This code covers the initial 15 minutes of an acupuncture session, including: 1) Consultation with the patient 2) Taking a medical history 3) Determining the appropriate acupuncture points 4) Inserting the needles 5) Monitoring the patient during treatment. 97811: Acupuncture, subsequent 15 minutes (same or separate area). This code covers each additional 15 minutes of acupuncture treatment provided in the same session, regardless of whether the needles are placed in the same or different areas. 97813: refers to acupuncture treatment with electrical stimulation. That is, acupuncture, 1 or more needles, with electrical stimulation, initial 15 minutes of personal one-on-one contact with the patient. 97814: Acupuncture, additional 15 minutes with electrical stimulation (same or separate area). This code covers an additional 15 minutes of acupuncture treatment where electrical stimulation is applied to the needles. This can enhance the effects of acupuncture and is often used for pain relief. Examples of allowed code combinations for manual with manual or manual with electrical or electrical with electrical include: 97810 + 97811 Manual initial with additional manual 97810 + 97814 Manual initial with additional electrical 97810 + 97811 + 97814 Manual initial with additional manual and electrical 97813 + 97814 Electrical initial with additional electrical 97813 + 97811 Electrical initial with additional manual 97813 + 97814 + 97811 Electrical initial with additional electrical and manual",
      "exp_hant": "這四個保險代碼97810、97811、97813及97814皆與針灸相關程序有關，但各自涵蓋治療的不同層面。97810：針灸，初次15分鐘。此代碼涵蓋一次針灸療程的最初15分鐘，包括：1）與病患諮詢 2）採集病史 3）決定適當的針灸穴位 4）進針 5）治療期間監測病患狀況。97811：針灸，後續15分鐘（相同或不同部位）。此代碼涵蓋同一療程中額外增加的每15分鐘針灸治療，不論針具是置於相同或不同部位。97813：指含電刺激的針灸治療，即針灸使用一根或多根針並施加電刺激，與病患一對一接觸的初次15分鐘。97814：針灸，含電刺激的額外15分鐘（相同或不同部位）。此代碼涵蓋針具施以電刺激的額外15分鐘針灸治療，可增強針灸效果，常用於止痛。允許的代碼組合範例，包括徒手配徒手、徒手配電刺激，或電刺激配電刺激：97810 + 97811 徒手初次加額外徒手；97810 + 97814 徒手初次加額外電刺激；97810 + 97811 + 97814 徒手初次加額外徒手及電刺激；97813 + 97814 電刺激初次加額外電刺激；97813 + 97811 電刺激初次加額外徒手；97813 + 97814 + 97811 電刺激初次加額外電刺激及徒手。"
