      ],
      "exp_en": "The brain stem includes the midbrain, the pons and medulla oblongata. The pons relays sensory information between the cerebellum and the cerebrum while also regulating arousal and breathing. The medulla controls blood pressure, heart rate, breathing and other autonomic functions. There are three types of neurons involved in the respiratory control center. One group consists of inspiratory neurons in the back of the medulla, a group that includes both inspiratory and expiratory neurons in the front of the medulla, and a group of neuron in the pons that discharge in both inspiration and expiration. The midbrain functions in motor movement, particularly movements of the eye, and in auditory and visual processing.",
      "exp_hant": "腦幹包括中腦、橋腦及延腦。橋腦在小腦與大腦之間傳遞感覺訊息，同時也調節覺醒程度與呼吸。延腦控制血壓、心跳、呼吸及其他自主功能。呼吸控制中樞涉及三類神經元：一組是位於延腦後側的吸氣神經元，另一組是位於延腦前側、同時包含吸氣及呼氣神經元的群組，還有一組位於橋腦、於吸氣與呼氣時皆會放電的神經元。中腦的功能與運動動作有關，尤其是眼球運動，以及聽覺與視覺處理。"
