      ],
      "exp_en": "Fibrinolysis is a process that prevents blood clots from growing too large and becoming a problem. It is a process that occurs inside the body to break down blood clots. This prevents blood clots from remaining in place and growing and allows the body to safely clear clot fragments to avoid risks such as strokes and heart damage that can occur with large floating clots.",
      "exp_hant": "纖維蛋白溶解是防止血栓長得過大而造成問題的過程，是體內用來分解血栓的機制。此過程可防止血栓停留原地並持續增大，並讓身體能安全清除血栓碎片，以避免大型漂浮血栓可能造成的中風與心臟損傷等風險。"
