      "number": 544,
      "question_en": "The brain produces a compound very similar to THC (tetrahydrocannabinol) called",
      "question_hant": "大腦會產生一種與THC（四氫大麻酚）非常相似的化合物，稱為",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
