      ],
      "exp_en": "Fluoroquinolones are bactericidal. They stop bacteria by interfering with their ability to make DNA. This activity makes it difficult for bacteria to multiply. They are used for respiratory tract, urinary tract, skin, and certain sexually transmitted diseases. Fluoroquinolones are very effective against most bacterial causes of infectious diarrhea. Fluoroquinolones can cause tendinitis and tendon ruptures. tcmtests.com, May 2020",
      "exp_hant": "氟喹諾酮類（fluoroquinolones）具殺菌作用，藉由干擾細菌製造DNA的能力來抑制細菌，使其難以繁殖。此類藥物用於治療呼吸道、泌尿道、皮膚感染及某些性傳染病，對大多數由細菌引起的感染性腹瀉也相當有效。氟喹諾酮類藥物可能引起肌腱炎及肌腱斷裂。tcmtests.com，2020年5月"
