      ],
      "exp_en": "THERAPEUTIC: Hawthorn can treat mild to moderate heart failure in some patients. Some research suggests that hawthorn may reduce chest pain (angina). Hawthorn may be able to treat an irregular heartbeat (arrhythmias). Some research shows that hawthorn might reduce blood pressure. CONTRAINDICATIONS: In some people, hawthorn can cause nausea, fatigue, sweating, headache, dizziness, palpitations, insomnia, and agitation. DRUG INTERACTIONS: The drug digoxin (Lanoxin) increases heart contraction. Concurrent use of hawthorn along with digoxin may increase the effect of digoxin and raises the risk of more side effects. Beta-blockers and calcium channel blockers lower blood pressure. Concurrent use with hawthorn along with these drugs might increase the risk of lowering blood pressure too much. Hawthorn increases heart blood flow. Concurrent use with anti-angina drugs that also increase heart blood increases the risk of dizziness. www.webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "治療作用：山楂在部分病人中可治療輕度至中度心臟衰竭。部分研究顯示山楂可能減輕胸痛（心絞痛）。山楂或可用於治療心律不整。部分研究顯示山楂可能降低血壓。禁忌：對某些人而言，山楂可能引起噁心、疲勞、出汗、頭痛、頭暈、心悸、失眠及躁動不安。藥物交互作用：毛地黃（digoxin，商品名Lanoxin）可增強心臟收縮力。若與山楂併用，可能增強毛地黃的作用，並提高副作用發生的風險。乙型阻斷劑與鈣離子通道阻斷劑可降低血壓，若與山楂併用，可能使血壓過度降低。山楂可增加心臟血流量，若與同樣能增加心臟血流的抗心絞痛藥物併用，可能提高頭暈的風險。www.webmd.com"
