      "exp_en": "THERAPEUTIC: SAMe can improve symptoms of osteoarthritis and work as well as aspirin and similar drugs but can take twice as long before improvement is seen. SAMe may reduce symptoms of major depression in some patients. SAMe may improve fibromyalgia symptoms. SAMe when taken with antidepressants may improve sexual functioning in men with depression. CONTRAINDICATIONS: Common side effects include diarrhea, constipation, dry mouth, headache, mild insomnia, anxiety, and poor appetite. There is insufficient reliable data about the safety of taking oral SAMe during pregnancy or breast-feeding and it is best to avoid using it. SAMe may cause patients with bipolar disorder to change from depression to mania. SAMe may worsen symptoms of Parkinson's disease. DRUG INTERACTIONS: Drugs that increase serotonin levels such as the antidepressants and MAOIs such as fluoxetine (Prozac), paroxetine (Paxil), sertraline (Zoloft), and phenelzine (Nardil) can have a synergistic effect with 5-HTP to increase serotonin to high levels resulting in including heart problems, shivering, and anxiety. The same can occur with OTC dextromethorphan (Robitussin DM) which also increases serotonin. Concurrent use of SAMe along with levodopa may worsen symptoms of Parkinson's disease. www.webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "治療作用：SAMe可改善骨關節炎症狀，效果與阿斯匹靈及類似藥物相當，但可能需要兩倍的時間才會出現療效。SAMe對部分重度憂鬱症病人可能有助於減輕症狀。SAMe可能改善纖維肌痛症的症狀。憂鬱症男性病人若將SAMe與抗憂鬱藥併用，可能改善性功能。禁忌：常見副作用包括腹瀉、便秘、口乾、頭痛、輕度失眠、焦慮及食慾不振。目前缺乏足夠可靠的資料證明懷孕或哺乳期間口服SAMe的安全性，故最好避免使用。SAMe可能使雙相情緒障礙症病人由憂鬱轉為躁狂發作。SAMe可能使帕金森氏症症狀惡化。藥物交互作用：會提高血清素濃度的藥物，如抗憂鬱藥及單胺氧化酶抑制劑（MAOIs），例如氟西汀（百憂解）、帕羅西汀（Paxil）、舍曲林（樂復得）及苯乙肼（Nardil），若與5-HTP併用可能產生協同作用，使血清素濃度過高，導致心臟問題、顫抖及焦慮等症狀。非處方藥右美沙芬（如Robitussin DM）也會提高血清素，可能出現相同情況。SAMe若與左旋多巴（levodopa）併用，可能使帕金森氏症症狀惡化。www.webmd.com"
