      "exp_en": "This is the best answer. Turmeric does treat osteoarthritis, inflammation, and hyperlipidemia. It does not treat GERD or pre-eclampsia. It interacts with anticoagulant and diabetic drugs but not antidepressants or anti-seizure medications. THERAPEUTIC: Turmeric is commonly used to to treat the pain and inflammation of osteoarthritis. Turmeric can treat hyperlipidemia to lower triglyceride blood levels. Curcumin, which is found in turmeric, may reduce hay fever symptoms (as sneezing, itching, nasal congestion). Turmeric extract reduces markers of liver injury in patients with liver disease, not caused by alcohol. CONTRAINDICATIONS:Turmeric as a spice in foods is likely safe during pregnancy or during breast-feeding. However, turmeric as a supplement is likely unsafe as it might promote menstruation or stimulate the uterus. Turmeric may worsen symptoms of GERD. Turmeric may slow blood clotting thus increasing the risk of bruising and bleeding in patients with bleeding problems. DRUG INTERACTIONS: Turmeric can slow blood clotting. Concurrent use with anticoagulants and antiplatelets may increase the risk of bruising and bleeding. Curcumin, a chemical in turmeric, can decrease blood sugar levels. Concurrent use with diabetic drugs may decrease blood sugar levels too much. Turmeric aids digestion by stimulating stomach acid. Concurrent use can interfere with acid-reducing drugs (proton pump inhibitors, H2 blockers, antacids). www.webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "這是最佳答案。薑黃確實可治療骨關節炎、發炎及高血脂，但不能治療胃食道逆流或子癲前症。它會與抗凝血劑及糖尿病藥物產生交互作用，但不會與抗憂鬱藥或抗癲癇藥物產生交互作用。治療作用：薑黃常用於治療骨關節炎的疼痛與發炎。薑黃可治療高血脂，降低三酸甘油酯血中濃度。薑黃中所含的薑黃素可能減輕花粉熱症狀（如打噴嚏、搔癢、鼻塞）。薑黃萃取物可降低非酒精性肝病病人的肝損傷指標。禁忌：薑黃作為食物中的香料，在懷孕或哺乳期間可能是安全的。然而，作為補充品的薑黃可能不安全，因其可能促進月經或刺激子宮。薑黃可能使胃食道逆流症狀惡化。薑黃可能減緩凝血，因此增加有出血問題病人瘀傷與出血的風險。藥物交互作用：薑黃可減緩凝血，與抗凝血劑及抗血小板藥物併用可能增加瘀傷與出血的風險。薑黃中的化學成分薑黃素可降低血糖濃度，與糖尿病藥物併用可能使血糖降得過低。薑黃可刺激胃酸分泌，有助消化，併用可能干擾降酸藥物（質子幫浦抑制劑、H2受體阻斷劑、制酸劑）的作用。www.webmd.com"
