      "exp_en": "An adnexal mass is a tissue lump in the adnexa of uterus (ovary, fallopian tube). Adnexal masses can be benign or cancerous. In ovarian cancer, an adexenal mass (solid, irregular, fixed) can be incidently discovered during pelvic examination. An ovarian mass in older women is more likely to be cancerous. Ovarian cancer is often undetected until it has metastized to the pelvis and abdomen. Late stage, ovarian cancer is difficult to treat and is often fatal. Early-stage ovarian cancer (confined to the ovary only) has a greater chance of successful treatment. Early-stage ovarian cancer usually does not have symptoms. Advanced-stage ovarian cancer may cause symptoms (abdominal pain, constipation, irritable bowel) that can be mistaken by the patient as common benign conditions. Ovarian cancer is suspected in patients who have unexplained adnexal mass (lump in ovaries) unexplained abdominal bloating and pain, quick satiety after eating, unintended weight loss, pelvic discomfort, frequent urination, changes in bowel habits, back pain. The stages of ovarian cancer: in stage I the cancer is in one or both ovaries. In stage II the cancer has metastasized (spread) to other pelvic areas. In stage III the cancer has metastasized to the abdomen. In stage IV the cancer has metastasized outside the abdomen. Phyllodes tumors are rare breast tumors. Hemangiomas are benign growths consisting of a collection excess blood cells which can be seen on the skin surface known as strawberry marks. Sarcoma are tumors that originate in the connective tissue (cartilage, bones, fat, nerves). The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page 2119",
      "exp_hant": "附件腫塊是指子宮附件（卵巢、輸卵管）處的組織腫塊，可能為良性或惡性。在卵巢癌中，骨盆腔檢查時可能意外發現附件腫塊（實質、形狀不規則、固定不動）。年齡較大女性的卵巢腫塊較可能為惡性。卵巢癌往往在轉移至骨盆腔及腹腔之前不易被發現。晚期卵巢癌難以治療，且常致命；早期卵巢癌（僅侷限於卵巢）成功治療的機會較高，但早期卵巢癌通常沒有症狀。晚期卵巢癌可能出現的症狀（腹痛、便秘、腸躁）容易被病人誤認為常見的良性狀況。若病人出現不明原因的附件腫塊（卵巢腫塊）、不明原因的腹脹與腹痛、進食後很快有飽足感、非刻意的體重減輕、骨盆不適、頻尿、排便習慣改變、背痛等，則應懷疑卵巢癌。卵巢癌的分期：第一期癌症侷限於一側或雙側卵巢；第二期癌症已轉移（擴散）至骨盆腔其他部位；第三期癌症已轉移至腹腔；第四期癌症已轉移至腹腔以外。葉狀腫瘤是一種罕見的乳房腫瘤。血管瘤是一種良性增生，由過多血球聚集而成，可見於皮膚表面，俗稱草莓記。肉瘤是起源於結締組織（軟骨、骨骼、脂肪、神經）的腫瘤。《默克診療手冊》，第18版，第2119頁"
