      "exp_en": "She shows no indication of a breast tumor. It would have been worrisome if the discharge was bloody or clear. On the other hand, breast discharge that is green, milky, or other colors is almost always not a concern. The breast discharge is most likely due to high prolactin levels. Galactorrhea is excessive or inappropriate production of milk. Hyperprolactinemia occurs when person has higher-than-normal levels of the hormone prolactin whose main function is to stimulate breast milk production after childbirth. High prolactin levels are normal during pregnancy. Exercise induced amenorrhea is the absence of monthly periods caused primarily by intense exercise which alters gonadotropin releasing hormone (GnRH) production from the hypothalamus. GnRH stimulates the synthesis and secretion of the gonadotropins, follicle-stimulating hormone (FSH), and luteinizing hormone (LH). Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, page 301, 710",
      "exp_hant": "她並無乳房腫瘤的跡象。若分泌物為血性或清澈無色，才較令人擔憂；相反地，呈綠色、乳白色或其他顏色的乳房分泌物幾乎都不需擔心。此乳房分泌物最可能是泌乳素濃度過高所致。乳漏症是指乳汁分泌過多或不當。高泌乳素血症是指體內泌乳素（其主要功能是在產後刺激乳汁分泌）濃度高於正常值。懷孕期間泌乳素濃度升高屬正常現象。運動誘發性停經則是指主要因劇烈運動改變下視丘促性腺激素釋放激素（GnRH）分泌所導致的月經停止。GnRH可刺激促性腺激素——濾泡刺激素（FSH）及黃體成長激素（LH）——的合成與分泌。《生物醫學：針灸與東方醫學從業人員教科書》，2007年，Robinson著，第301、710頁"
