      "exp_en": "Benign positional vertigo is a very common cause of vertigo which is the patient feels a sudden sensation of spinning or that the inside of their head is spinning. Benign positional vertigo causes brief episodes of mild to intense dizziness. It is usually triggered by changes in the position of the head as occur when moving the head up or down, when lying down, or when turning over or sitting up in bed. Symptoms include dizziness, a sense that the environment is spinning or moving (vertigo), loss of balance, nausea/vomiting. Other possible diagnosis include hypertension, advanced atherosclerosis, possible heart failure, and possible venous insufficiency. Benign positional vertigo is not a red flag case but he does need a referral to an internist. Thalassemia is an inherited blood disease which affects the ability to produce red blood cells. Meniere's Disease is an ear disorder with vertigo affecting balance and often accompanied with tinnitus. The symptoms of temporal lobe tumors include memory loss, speech problems, headaches, and seizures. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, page 185, 708",
      "exp_hant": "良性陣發性姿勢性眩暈是引起眩暈的常見原因，病人會突然感覺天旋地轉，或彷彿腦內在旋轉。此病會引起短暫發作的輕度至強烈頭暈，通常由頭部姿勢改變所誘發，例如低頭或抬頭、躺下，或在床上翻身、坐起時。症狀包括頭暈、感覺環境在旋轉或移動（眩暈）、失去平衡感、噁心／嘔吐。其他可能的診斷包括高血壓、進行性動脈粥狀硬化、可能的心臟衰竭，以及可能的靜脈功能不全。良性陣發性姿勢性眩暈並非紅旗警訊病例，但仍需轉診至內科醫師。地中海型貧血是一種遺傳性血液疾病，影響紅血球的生成能力。梅尼爾氏病是一種影響平衡的耳部疾病，會引起眩暈，並常伴隨耳鳴。顳葉腫瘤的症狀包括記憶喪失、言語障礙、頭痛及癲癇發作。《生物醫學：針灸與東方醫學從業人員教科書》，2007年，Robinson著，第185、708頁"
