      "question_en": "A patient has fainted in the treatment room and has fallen to the floor. The patient responds to your question and breathing is normal. What is the next step?",
      "question_hant": "一位病人在治療室中暈倒並跌倒在地。病人對你的問話有反應，呼吸也正常。下一步該怎麼做？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "loosen any tight clothing or belt",
          "hant": "鬆開緊身的衣物或腰帶",
          "correct": false
