        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Lymphocytes are small, round cells located in in the peripheral blood, lymph, lymph nodes, lymphoid organs (thymus, spleen, tonsils, appendix) and in tissues. Based on their function and cell components lymphocytes are divided into three groups: T-lymphocytes or T-cells, B-lymphocytes or B-cells, and Natural killer cells (NK). Both T-Cells and B-cells are part of the adaptive immune system. NK cells are part of the innate immune system. B-cells provide antibody immunity and T-cells provide cell mediated immunity. Antibody-mediated immunity, also called humoral immunity, produces specific antibodies against a specific antigen. The produced antibodies by the B-cells bind to antigens to neutralize them, destroy the cell (lysis) or initiate phagocytosis. Cellular immunity occurs inside infected cells mediated by T-lymphocytes (T-cells). T-cells bind to the infected cells to initiate lysis. There are two types of T-cells: helper T-cells and killer T-cells (not the same as natural killer cells). Helper T-cells recognize antigens and signal to the B-cells to make antibodies to attack them. Killer T-cells directly kill cells that have already been infected by a foreign invader. T-cells also use cytokines as messenger molecules to send chemical instructions to the rest of the immune system to ramp up its response. T-cells are called memory cells because if the immune system encounters the same antigen again then it signals the B-cells to produce antibodies to attack them. tcmtests.com, February 2020",
      "exp_hant": "淋巴球是位於周邊血液、淋巴液、淋巴結、淋巴器官（胸腺、脾臟、扁桃腺、闌尾）及組織中的小型圓形細胞。依其功能及細胞組成，淋巴球可分為三類：T淋巴球（T細胞）、B淋巴球（B細胞），以及自然殺手細胞（NK細胞）。T細胞與B細胞皆屬於適應性免疫系統的一部分，NK細胞則屬於先天性免疫系統。B細胞提供抗體免疫，T細胞提供細胞媒介免疫。抗體媒介免疫，亦稱體液性免疫，會針對特定抗原產生特異性抗體。B細胞產生的抗體會與抗原結合，使其失去活性、破壞該細胞（溶解），或啟動吞噬作用。細胞免疫則發生於受感染細胞內部，由T淋巴球（T細胞）所媒介，T細胞會與受感染細胞結合，啟動溶解作用。T細胞分為兩種：輔助型T細胞與殺手型T細胞（與自然殺手細胞不同）。輔助型T細胞可辨識抗原，並向B細胞發出訊號，使其產生抗體以攻擊該抗原；殺手型T細胞則直接殺死已被外來入侵者感染的細胞。T細胞也會利用細胞激素作為傳訊分子，向免疫系統其餘部分傳遞化學指令，以加強其反應。T細胞又被稱為記憶細胞，因為若免疫系統再次遇到相同抗原，便會向B細胞發出訊號，促使其產生抗體加以攻擊。tcmtests.com，2020年2月"
