      "question_en": "The two components of the immune system are the innate (cellular) immune system and the adaptive (humoral) immune system. Within this framework, how do vaccines work?",
      "question_hant": "免疫系統的兩大組成部分為先天性（細胞性）免疫系統與適應性（體液性）免疫系統。在此架構下，疫苗是如何發揮作用的？",
