          "hant": "高三酸甘油酯",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Low BMI",
          "hant": "低BMI（身體質量指數）",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Low RBCs",
          "hant": "低紅血球數",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The risk factors for diabetes include: 1) weight: the greater the amount of fatty tissue in the body, the more resistant the cells are to insulin. 2) age: the risk increases as one grows older (less exercise, muscle mass loss, weight gain) but type 2 diabetes is increasing among children. 3) inactivity: the less a person is active the greater the risk because physical activity controls and makes the cells more sensitive to insulin. 4) family history: the risk increases if a parent or brother/sister has type 2 diabetes. 5) race: the reason is not known but Hispanics, blacks, Asians, and Native Americans have a greater risk. 6) hypertension: blood pressure over 140/90mm Hg increases the risk of type 2 diabetes. 7) cholesterol levels: low HDL (high-density lipoprotein, the good cholesterol) increases the risk for type 2 diabetes. 8) triglycerides: high triglyceride levels increase the risk of type 2 diabetes. Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests, 7th Edition, Pagana, page 1090; 4th Edition page 1166; webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "糖尿病的危險因子包括：1）體重：體內脂肪組織愈多，細胞對胰島素的抗性愈高。2）年齡：年齡愈大風險愈高（運動量減少、肌肉量流失、體重增加），但第二型糖尿病在兒童中也日漸增加。3）活動量不足：活動量愈少風險愈高，因為身體活動能控制並提高細胞對胰島素的敏感度。4）家族病史：若父母或兄弟姊妹罹患第二型糖尿病，風險會增加。5）種族：原因尚不明確，但西班牙裔、黑人、亞裔及美洲原住民的風險較高。6）高血壓：血壓超過140/90 mmHg會增加第二型糖尿病風險。7）膽固醇濃度：低HDL（高密度脂蛋白，即好膽固醇）會增加第二型糖尿病風險。8）三酸甘油酯：三酸甘油酯濃度偏高會增加第二型糖尿病風險。《Mosby診斷與檢驗手冊》第7版，Pagana著，第1090頁；第4版，第1166頁；webmd.com"
    },
