      "exp_en": "Testing for diabetes should be considered in all individuals at age 45 years and above, particularly in those with a BMI &gt; 25 kg/m. If normal, tests should be repeated at 3 year intervals. The greater the amount of fatty tissue in the body (BMI), the more resistant the cells are to insulin and the greater the risk of developing type 2 diabetes. A Manual of Laboratory and Diagnostic Tests, 7th Edition, Fischbach, page 326",
      "exp_hant": "所有年滿45歲以上的人皆應考慮接受糖尿病檢測，尤其是BMI大於25 kg/m者。若檢測結果正常，應每3年重複檢測一次。體內脂肪組織愈多（BMI愈高），細胞對胰島素的抗性愈強，罹患第二型糖尿病的風險也愈高。《實驗室與診斷檢驗手冊》第7版，Fischbach著，第326頁"
