    {
      "number": 658,
      "question_en": "The Ferritin blood test assesses iron stores in the body. Approximately what percentage of pregnant women have iron deficiency anemia?",
      "question_hant": "鐵蛋白血液檢測用於評估體內鐵質儲存量。大約有多少比例的孕婦患有缺鐵性貧血？",
