          "en": "Screens for possible diabetes",
          "hant": "用於篩檢可能的糖尿病",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "A urine glucose test indirectly determines your blood glucose levels. If blood glucose rises above normal levels, then the kidneys filter it out into the urine. This test does not treat diabetes but it is used to screen for diabetes. It is part of a routine urinalysis and part of a CMP (Comprehensive Metabolic Panel). Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests, 7th Edition, Pagana, page 891; 4th Edition page 969",
      "exp_hant": "尿糖檢測是間接測定血糖濃度的方法。若血糖濃度超過正常值，腎臟便會將多餘的糖分過濾至尿液中。此檢測並非糖尿病的治療方式，而是用於糖尿病篩檢，屬於常規尿液分析及CMP（全套代謝檢查）的一部分。《Mosby診斷與檢驗手冊》第7版，Pagana著，第891頁；第4版，第969頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 660,
      "question_en": "Kyphosis is",
      "question_hant": "脊柱後凸（駝背）是指",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Increased concavity in the curvature of the lumbar spine",
          "hant": "腰椎曲度的凹度增加",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Abnormal posterior curve",
          "hant": "異常的向後彎曲",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Abnormal lateral curve of the spine",
          "hant": "脊柱的異常側彎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Increased convexity in the curvature of the thoracic spine",
          "hant": "胸椎曲度的凸度增加",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Scoliosis, kyphosis and lordosis all refer to the curvature of the spine. Lordosis is commonly called swayback. Kyphosis is commonly called humpback or round back. Scoliosis is an abnormal sideward curvature to either the left or right. In scoliosis the spine curves to the side like a C or S shape. In lordosis the spine deviates inwards to the body. In kyphosis the spine deviates outwards from the body. Scoliosis is an abnormal curvature of the spine in the coronal (lateral) plane. Scoliosis between 10-20 degrees is considered mild and less than 10 degrees is a normal postural variation. Lordosis or hyperlordosis is excessive curving of the lower spine. Lordosis is often associated with scoliosis or kyphosis. Kyphosis is an excess curvature of the spine in the sagittal (A-P) plane. Normally, the upper back has 20-45 degrees of curvature. Anything in excess of 45 degrees is called kyphosis. Combined kyphosis and scoliosis is termed kyphoscoliosis. webmde.com",
      "exp_hant": "脊柱側彎、脊柱後凸與脊柱前凸皆是描述脊柱曲度的名詞。脊柱前凸俗稱「凹背」，脊柱後凸俗稱「駝背」或「圓背」，脊柱側彎則是指脊柱向左或向右的異常側向彎曲。脊柱側彎時，脊柱會呈C形或S形向側邊彎曲；脊柱前凸時，脊柱向身體內側偏移；脊柱後凸時，脊柱則向身體外側偏移。脊柱側彎是脊柱在冠狀（側向）面上的異常彎曲，介於10至20度視為輕度，低於10度則屬正常姿勢變異。脊柱前凸（或稱過度前凸）是下段脊柱的過度彎曲，常與脊柱側彎或脊柱後凸並存。脊柱後凸則是脊柱在矢狀（前後）面上的過度彎曲，正常上背部曲度約為20至45度，超過45度即稱為脊柱後凸。脊柱後凸合併脊柱側彎則稱為脊柱後側凸。webmde.com"
    },
    {
      "number": 661,
      "question_en": "The ESR can test for autoimmune diseases. Which of the following are autoimmune diseases?",
      "question_hant": "紅血球沉降率（ESR）可用於檢測自體免疫疾病。以下何者屬於自體免疫疾病？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Rheumatoid arthritis, Osteoarthritis, Scleroderma, Raynaud's disease",
          "hant": "類風濕性關節炎、骨關節炎、硬皮症、雷諾氏病",
