        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Small intestine tumors, Small intestine obstruction, Inflammatory bowel diseases",
          "hant": "小腸腫瘤、小腸阻塞、發炎性腸道疾病",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. A small-bowel follow-through, also called small-bowel series, is an X-ray exam that visualizes the small intestine from the distal duodenum/duodenojejunal junction to the ileocecal valve. The SBF is often combined with the upper GI series which examines the esophagus and stomach. The SBF is ordered when small intestine cancer is suspected, when the occult fecal blood test is positive, when there is a suspected obstruction in the small intestine. It is also performed to help evaluate inflammatory bowel diseases (Crohn's, IBS, ulcerative colitis). Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Studies, 7th Edition, Pagana, page 1044-1047; 4th Edition, page 1127-1130",
      "exp_hant": "這是最完整且正確的答案。小腸追蹤攝影，又稱小腸系列攝影，是一種X光檢查，用於顯示自十二指腸遠端／十二指腸空腸交界處至迴盲瓣之間的小腸影像。SBF常與檢查食道與胃部的上消化道攝影系列合併進行。當懷疑小腸癌、糞便潛血檢測呈陽性，或懷疑小腸阻塞時，皆會安排此檢查，也用於協助評估發炎性腸道疾病（克隆氏症、大腸激躁症、潰瘍性結腸炎）。《Mosby診斷與檢驗手冊》第7版，Pagana著，第1044-1047頁；第4版，第1127-1130頁"
    },
