      "exp_en": "A skull X-ray can help discover injuries, bone fractures, foreign objects, or abnormal growths in the bones of the skull. Skull X-rays have for the most part been replaced by CT scans (Computed Tomography). Mosby's Manual of Diagnostic and Laboratory Tests, 7th Edition,Pagana, page 1041-1044; 4th Edition page 1124-1125",
      "exp_hant": "頭顱X光有助於發現顱骨的損傷、骨折、異物或異常增生。如今頭顱X光大多已被電腦斷層掃描（CT）取代。《Mosby診斷與檢驗手冊》第7版，Pagana著，第1041-1044頁；第4版，第1124-1125頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 669,
      "question_en": "The dipstick urine (urine reagent strips) testing",
      "question_hant": "尿液試紙（尿液試劑條）檢測",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Has a color that correlates with cortisol levels",
          "hant": "顏色與皮質醇濃度相關",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Provides definitive diagnosis",
          "hant": "可提供確定性診斷",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Provides preliminary diagnosis",
          "hant": "可提供初步診斷",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Has only false-negative results",
          "hant": "只會出現偽陰性結果",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "A urine sample is evaluated in three ways: 1) dipstick test, 2) visual exam, and 3) through a microscopic exam. The dipstick test can give both false-positive and false-negative results. This test does detect cortisol. The standard urine test strip can include up to 10 different reagents (pads that change color) which react (strip reacts in 60-120 seconds) when dipped in a sample of urine. The dipstick urine test strip can be the first diagnostic step as measures for the presence of glucose , ketones, proteins, acetone, nitrite, WBCs, RBCs, bilirubin, pH levels, and gravity. Any glucose or ketones in the urine calls for further testing for diabetes. Bilirubin in the urine may point to a liver disorder. The presence of nitrites or leukocytes can point to a UTI (urinary tract infection). Blood in the urine can indicate infection, kidney/bladder stones, blood disorders, or kidney/bladder cancer. tcmtests.com, April 2020",
      "exp_hant": "尿液檢體的評估方式有三種：1）試紙檢測；2）目視檢查；3）顯微鏡檢查。試紙檢測可能出現偽陽性與偽陰性結果，此項檢測確實可偵測皮質醇。標準尿液試紙最多可包含10種不同試劑（會變色的反應墊），浸入尿液樣本後會產生反應（反應時間為60至120秒）。尿液試紙可作為診斷的第一步，用以測量葡萄糖、酮體、蛋白質、丙酮、亞硝酸鹽、白血球、紅血球、膽紅素、酸鹼值及比重等項目。尿中若出現葡萄糖或酮體，需進一步檢測糖尿病；尿中膽紅素可能提示肝臟疾病；亞硝酸鹽或白血球的存在可能提示泌尿道感染（UTI）；尿中帶血則可能顯示感染、腎／膀胱結石、血液疾病，或腎／膀胱癌。tcmtests.com，2020年4月"
    },
