    {
      "number": 684,
      "question_en": "Women who smoke and are taking oral birth control pills are an increased risk of heart attack. This is because birth control ________ the blood and cigarette smoking ________the blood.",
      "question_hant": "吸菸且服用口服避孕藥的女性，發生心臟病的風險會增加，這是因為避孕藥會使血液________，而吸菸則會使血液________。",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "thins, thickens",
          "hant": "變稀，變濃稠",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "thins, thins",
          "hant": "變稀，變稀",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "thickens, thickens",
          "hant": "變濃稠，變濃稠",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "thickens, thins",
          "hant": "變濃稠，變稀",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The hormones used in combined birth control pills can also have a minor effect on the thickening of the blood. Add smoking into the equation and just like birth control pills, smoking can also thicken the blood. Research shows that smokers have higher hematocrit and hemoglobin levels than non-smokers. Birth control pills can have a mild effect on increasing the risk of stroke and other cardiovascular diseases. Cigarettes impose a greater risk. The two together can seriously increase the risk to life-threatening heart issues. Most people see cigarette smoking associated with lung disorders such as lung cancer. However, smoking is a major cause of heart disease for both men and women. About 20 percent of all deaths from heart disease in the US are directly due to cigarette smoking. Smoking is a major cause of coronary artery disease. The risk of heart disease and heart attack greatly increases with the number of cigarettes smoked and the longer people smoke. Individuals who smoke a pack of cigarettes a day have more than twice the risk of heart attack than nonsmokers. Smoking while on birth control pills can pose a serious risk to health. Women who smoke and also take birth control pills increase several times their risk of heart attack, stroke, and peripheral vascular disease. Smokers have an increased risk for stroke that is 2 times higher. For peripheral vascular disease the risk is 10 times higher and for COPD the risk is 10 times higher. For lung cancer mortality the risk is 23 times higher. Bates's Guide to Physical Examination, 13th Edition, page 179; Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 10th Edition, page 293",
      "exp_hant": "複方口服避孕藥中所使用的荷爾蒙，對血液濃稠度也有輕微的增加作用。若再加上吸菸，情況更為明顯，因為吸菸同樣會使血液變濃稠。研究顯示，吸菸者的血比容與血紅素濃度皆高於非吸菸者。避孕藥對於增加中風及其他心血管疾病風險僅有輕微影響，而香菸帶來的風險則更為顯著；兩者併用會大幅提高危及生命的心臟問題風險。一般人多將吸菸與肺部疾病（如肺癌）聯想在一起，然而吸菸其實也是男女心臟病的主要成因之一。在美國，約有20%的心臟病死亡病例直接歸因於吸菸，吸菸也是冠狀動脈疾病的主要成因。心臟病與心臟病發作的風險，會隨吸菸支數增加及吸菸時間延長而顯著升高。每天吸一包菸的人，心臟病發作的風險是非吸菸者的兩倍以上。同時吸菸與服用避孕藥對健康構成嚴重風險：同時吸菸且服用避孕藥的女性，其心臟病發作、中風及周邊血管疾病的風險會提高數倍。吸菸者中風風險提高2倍，周邊血管疾病風險提高10倍，慢性阻塞性肺病（COPD）風險提高10倍，肺癌死亡率風險則提高23倍。《Bates身體檢查指南》第13版，第179頁；第10版，第293頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 685,
      "question_en": "Which cranial nerve provides sensory input to the posterior 1/3rd of the tongue?",
      "question_hant": "哪一對腦神經負責舌後三分之一的感覺輸入？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
