      "number": 698,
      "question_en": "A 37 year-old male construction worker is an IV drug user. He says that he always uses clean needles and at parties he shares needles with all his friends to get a group high. He is also an amateur boxer. He reports being very healthy with quick resolution of minor injuries and infections such as colds. Even though he has a drug habit he has yet to miss a day of work in the past seven years. He has come for medical help because as of five months ago he has had the flu with low-grade fever, body aches, shoulder pain, and right upper quadrant abdominal pain. He reports dark urine. His appetite is poor, often skipping meals. He has lost his desire for smoking even though he normally smokes two packs per day. The physical exam reveals scleral icterus. His body temperature is 100.6 F. The edge of his liver is tender. The liver is three finger breaths below the right coastal margin. The spleen is normal. What is the presumptive diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一名37歲男性建築工人為靜脈注射毒品使用者。他表示自己一向使用乾淨的針具，但在聚會時會與所有朋友共用針具以追求群體嗨感。他也是一名業餘拳擊手，自述身體十分健康，輕微外傷與感染（如感冒）皆能迅速痊癒，儘管有毒癮，但過去七年來他從未曠工。他此次前來就醫，是因為五個月前開始出現類似流感的症狀，包括低燒、全身痠痛、肩部疼痛及右上腹疼痛，並主訴尿液顏色偏深、食慾不振、常常不吃正餐，也失去了對吸菸的慾望（他原本每天吸兩包菸）。理學檢查發現有鞏膜黃疸，體溫為華氏100.6度（約攝氏38.1度），肝臟邊緣有壓痛，肝臟位於右肋緣下三指寬處，脾臟則正常。此病例的推定診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "liver inflammation",
          "hant": "肝臟發炎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "liver cancer",
          "hant": "肝癌",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "acute hepatitis B or C",
          "hant": "急性B型或C型肝炎",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "chronic viral hepatitis B or C",
          "hant": "慢性B型或C型病毒性肝炎",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Each type of hepatitis virus is different but they all target the liver. Different forms of hepatitis can have similar types of symptoms such as fever, joint pain, fatigue, nausea, loss of appetite, abdominal pain, dark urine, and jaundice. Icterus is the medical term for jaundice. Scleral icterus means yellowish eyes. An acute hepatitis infection is a short-term condition, less than six months. A chronic infection is more than six months. Both HBV an HCV can both be transmitted via injected drugs but injected drug users are at a higher risk of HCV. Sexual transmission is extremely rare in the transmission of HCV while being more common with HBV. Both HBV and HCV can cause hepatitis and both can lead to cirrhosis of the liver and liver cancer. Both HBV and HCV can be transmitted to someone when they are exposed to the blood of an infected person. HBV is caused by a DNA virus while HCV is caused by an RNA virus. Lab tests would reveal which type of hepatitis this patient has. A patient can be vaccinated against HBV but not with HCV. It's also possible to have both hepatitis B and C infections at the same time. Western Physical Exam Skills for Practitioners of Asian Medicine, 2009, Robinson, Wolfe, page 77",
      "exp_hant": "各型肝炎病毒雖不盡相同，但皆以肝臟為攻擊目標。不同型別的肝炎可能出現類似的症狀，例如發燒、關節痛、疲勞、噁心、食慾不振、腹痛、尿液顏色變深及黃疸。「Icterus」即黃疸的醫學術語，鞏膜黃疸則指眼白發黃。急性肝炎感染為短期病程，病程少於六個月；慢性感染則超過六個月。B型肝炎病毒（HBV）與C型肝炎病毒（HCV）皆可經由注射毒品傳染，但注射毒品者感染HCV的風險更高。性行為傳染在HCV中極為罕見，在HBV則較為常見。HBV與HCV皆可引發肝炎，兩者皆可能導致肝硬化與肝癌，也都可透過接觸感染者的血液傳染。HBV由DNA病毒引起，HCV則由RNA病毒引起。實驗室檢驗可判定患者所感染的肝炎型別。患者可接種HBV疫苗，但目前並無HCV疫苗；此外，患者也可能同時感染B型與C型肝炎。《亞洲醫學從業者西醫體檢技能》，2009年，Robinson、Wolfe著，第77頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 699,
      "question_en": "With the patient supine and the knee slightly flexed, you move the thigh about 30 degrees lateral to the side of the table, place one hand against the lateral knee to stabilize the femur and the other hand around the medial ankle to induce valgus stress through the knee joint. What test is being performed?",
      "question_hant": "患者採仰臥姿勢，膝關節略為屈曲，將大腿向床側外展約30度，一手抵住膝關節外側以固定股骨，另一手環繞內踝，對膝關節施加外翻應力，這是在進行什麼測試？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Anterior drawer sign",
          "hant": "前抽屜徵象",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Abduction stress test",
          "hant": "外展應力測試",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Adduction stress test",
          "hant": "內收應力測試",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "McMurray test",
          "hant": "麥克莫瑞測試",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "A valgus force is force applied on the outside of the knee, pushing in toward the body. The Abduction stress test evaluates the medial collateral ligament (MCL). MCL sprains are common in sports (football, martial arts, basketball) and can also occur through falls and twists of the knee joint. In grade 1, when the valgus force is applied there is pain but no joint laxity. In grade 2, there is significant tenderness over the MCL, some swelling, and the valgus force reveals moderate joint laxity. In grade 3, there is a complete tear of the ligament of the MCL, pain, and significant laxity of the knee when the valgus force is applied. After an injury, treatment involves applying the PRICE therapy (Protection, Rest, Ice, Compression, Elevation), for at least the first 72 hours or until a specialist does an evaluation. Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 13th Edition, page 807-809; Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 10th Edition, page 632-634",
      "exp_hant": "外翻應力是指施加於膝關節外側、將其推向身體內側的力量。外展應力測試用於評估內側副韌帶（MCL）。MCL扭傷常見於運動（如美式足球、武術、籃球），也可能因跌倒或膝關節扭轉而發生。第一級損傷施加外翻應力時會有疼痛但無關節鬆弛；第二級損傷時，MCL處有明顯壓痛及輕微腫脹，外翻應力測試顯示中度關節鬆弛；第三級損傷則為MCL完全斷裂，施加外翻應力時會有疼痛及膝關節顯著鬆弛。受傷後的治療包括採用PRICE療法（保護、休息、冰敷、加壓、抬高），至少持續72小時，或直到專科醫師完成評估為止。《Bates身體檢查指南》第13版，第807-809頁；第10版，第632-634頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 700,
      "question_en": "A 30 year old female has neck pain with bilateral weakness and paresthesia in both upper and lower extremities. There is hand clumsiness, palmar paresthesia, and walking difficulties. Neck flexion worsens the symptoms. What is the most likely diagnosis",
      "question_hant": "一名30歲女性有頸部疼痛，並伴有雙側上肢與下肢無力及感覺異常，出現手部笨拙、手掌感覺異常及行走困難，頸部屈曲會使症狀加重，最可能的診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
