      ],
      "exp_en": "This is also known colloquially as \"Housemaid's knee\". Prepatellar bursitis can also be caused by an acute trauma to the patella or in patients with gout. Prepatellar bursitis is an inflammation of the bursa in the front of the patella. It occurs when the bursa produces too much fluid making it swell and puts pressure on adjoining structures. Symptoms include knee pain with activity (not usually at night), rapid swelling or effusion on the front of patella, and patellar tenderness and warmth. Housemaid's knee is usually managed with rest. Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 13th Edition, page 806; Bate's Guide to Physical Examination, 10th Edition, page 629",
      "exp_hant": "此病俗稱「女僕膝」。髕前滑囊炎也可能因髕骨急性創傷或痛風患者而引起。髕前滑囊炎是髕骨前方滑囊的發炎。當滑囊分泌過多液體而腫脹時，會對周圍組織造成壓迫。症狀包括活動時膝痛（通常夜間不痛）、髕骨前方迅速腫脹或積液，以及髕骨壓痛與局部發熱。女僕膝通常以休息處理即可。《Bates身體評估指南》第13版，第806頁；《Bates身體評估指南》第10版，第629頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 703,
      "question_en": "The majority of over the counter sleep aids contain the antihistamine",
      "question_hant": "大多數非處方安眠藥所含的抗組織胺成分是",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "chlorpheniramine",
          "hant": "氯苯那敏（chlorpheniramine）",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "brompheniramine",
          "hant": "溴苯那敏（brompheniramine）",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "diphenhydramine",
          "hant": "苯海拉明（diphenhydramine）",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "clemastine",
          "hant": "氯馬斯汀（clemastine）",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Diphenhydramine and also doxylamine are two antihistamines used in OTC sleep aids that have sedative properties. They are often recommended for short-term treatment of insomnia or acute insomnia. Diphenhydramine is one of the ingredients found in Unisom, Tylenol PM, Advil PM, Aleve PM, ZzzQuil, Benadryl. Doxylamine is one of the ingredients in Alka-Seltzer Plus, Vicks NyQuill, Tylenol Cold and Cough Nighttime, Diphenhydramine is often selected as an OTC to relieve allergies or treat allergic reactions. It can also be helpful in preventing motion sickness. Doctors do not recommend the routine or chronic use of diphenhydramine to treat insomnia. Diphenhydramine and doxylamine are part of a class of medications called antihistamines. They work at the level of neurotransmitters. They allow the neurotransmitter histamine to accumulate in the synapses that are present between nerve cells. This leads to sedative effects. The sedative effect is accomplished by blocking the uptake histamine into nearby cells. Diphenhydramine and doxylamine work both centrally within the brain as well as in peripheral nerve cells in other parts of the body. They possess other therapeutic effects such as suppressing cough, nausea, and allergic reactions. Common side effects for both: dizziness, drowsiness, thick lung secretions, dry mouth or nose, and rapid or irregular heart rate. The other answers are also antihistamines which can produce drowsiness but they are not used in OTC sleep aids. tcmtests.com, February 2019",
      "exp_hant": "苯海拉明（diphenhydramine）與多西拉敏（doxylamine）是兩種具鎮靜作用、常用於非處方安眠藥的抗組織胺，常被推薦用於短期治療失眠或急性失眠。苯海拉明是Unisom、Tylenol PM、Advil PM、Aleve PM、ZzzQuil、Benadryl等產品的成分之一。多西拉敏則是Alka-Seltzer Plus、Vicks NyQuil、Tylenol Cold and Cough Nighttime等產品的成分之一。苯海拉明常被選作非處方藥以緩解過敏或治療過敏反應，也有助於預防暈車。醫師並不建議常規或長期使用苯海拉明來治療失眠。苯海拉明與多西拉敏屬於抗組織胺類藥物，作用於神經傳導物質層面，使組織胺在神經細胞間的突觸中累積，進而產生鎮靜效果。其鎮靜作用是透過阻斷附近細胞對組織胺的攝取而達成。苯海拉明與多西拉敏在腦部中樞及身體其他部位的周邊神經細胞均有作用，並具有抑制咳嗽、噁心與過敏反應等其他治療效果。兩者常見副作用包括頭暈、嗜睡、肺部分泌物變稠、口鼻乾燥，以及心跳加快或不規律。其餘選項雖同屬抗組織胺、也可能引起嗜睡，但並非用於非處方安眠藥。tcmtests.com，2019年2月"
