          "en": "Chloride channel activator: Amitiza (lubiprostone)",
          "hant": "氯離子通道活化劑：Amitiza（lubiprostone，魯比前列酮）",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The correct answers are: Chloride channel activator: Amitiza (lubiprostone). Guanylate cyclase-C agonist: Trulance (plecanatide). Opioid antagonist: Relistor (methylnaltrexone) and Movantik (naloxegol). Both Methylnaltrexone (Relistor) and Movantik (naloxegol) are classified as OPIOID ANTAGONISTS. An agonist amplifies the effect on a receptor. Both drugs are used to only treat opioid induced constipation. Opioids bind to brain pain receptors. However, they also bind to opioid receptors in the intestines, resulting in constipation. These drugs block opioid receptors in the intestines while still providing the pain relief of opioids. Common side effects include nausea, diarrhea, and abdominal pain. CHLORIDE CHANNEL ACTIVATORS increase water in the intestines. This is done by activating the chloride channels in the epithelial intestinal cells that secrete fluids. This results in increased stool softening and motility. Amitiza (lubiprostone) is prescribed to treat chronic idiopathic constipation, irritable bowel syndrome with constipation (IBS-C), and opioid induced constipation. Common side effects include diarrhea, nausea, and abdominal pain. GUANYLATE CYCLASE-C AGONISTS replicates naturally occurring uroguanylin which regulates intestinal electrolyte balance and water transport resulting in stool softening. Both Trulance (plecanatide) and Linzess (linaclotide) treat chronic idiopathic constipation and IBS-C, but NOT opioid induced constipation. Common side effects include diarrhea, gas, bloating, and abdominal pain. tcmtests.com, June 2020",
      "exp_hant": "正確答案為：氯離子通道活化劑：Amitiza（lubiprostone）。鳥苷酸環化酶-C促效劑：Trulance（plecanatide）。類鴉片拮抗劑：Relistor（methylnaltrexone）及Movantik（naloxegol）。Methylnaltrexone（Relistor）與Movantik（naloxegol）皆屬於「類鴉片拮抗劑」。促效劑會放大受體的作用效果。這兩種藥物僅用於治療鴉片類藥物引起的便秘。鴉片類藥物與腦內疼痛受體結合，但也會與腸道中的鴉片受體結合，導致便秘。這類藥物可阻斷腸道中的鴉片受體，同時仍保留鴉片類藥物的止痛效果。常見副作用包括噁心、腹瀉及腹痛。「氯離子通道活化劑」可增加腸道內的水分，其方式是活化腸道上皮細胞中分泌液體的氯離子通道，進而使糞便軟化並增加腸蠕動。Amitiza（lubiprostone）用於治療慢性特發性便秘、伴便秘型腸躁症（IBS-C），以及鴉片類藥物引起的便秘，常見副作用包括腹瀉、噁心及腹痛。「鳥苷酸環化酶-C促效劑」可複製體內天然存在、調節腸道電解質平衡與水分運送的尿鳥苷素，進而使糞便軟化。Trulance（plecanatide）與Linzess（linaclotide，利那洛肽）皆可治療慢性特發性便秘及IBS-C，但不能治療鴉片類藥物引起的便秘，常見副作用包括腹瀉、脹氣、腹脹及腹痛。tcmtests.com，2020年6月"
