      ],
      "exp_en": "Biologics reduce inflammation by inhibiting TNF (tumor necrosis factor). They are called TNF blockers. These drugs are genetically engineered antibodies made in the lab from human or animal tissue. They are administered via injection or subcutaneously. The immune system naturally makes TNF and keeps its level steady. TNFs control cell death and inflammation. In autoimmune diseases the body produces too much TNF which then activates the inflammatory process. Examples of TNF Blockers include: 1) Adalimumab (Humira), infliximab (Rimicade), and etanercept (Enbrel) which treat RA, psoriatic arthritis, Crohn's, ulcerative colitis, and ankylosing spondylitis. 2) rituximab (Rituxan) which treats non-Hodgkins lymphoma and chronic lymphocytic leukemia. 3) bevacizumab (Avastin) which treats breast, colorectal, kidney, lung, and ovarian cancers. 4) insulin glargine (Lantus) which treats diabetes. Common side effects of biological drugs include shortness of breath and chills. They also make the patient susceptible to infections as these drugs change the way the immune works. The other answers for this question list the mechanism of action of other drug classes that also reduce inflammation. Immunosuppressors block cellular purine synthesis. Purines are needed to produce cellular DNA/RNA. By inhibiting purine synthesis, less DNA/RNA is produced for the synthesis of white blood cells which then causes immunosuppression to reduce inflammation. Examples of drugs are azathioprine (Imuran, Azasan) and Mercaptopurine (Purinethol)which which treat RA, Crohn's disease, and ulcerative colitis. NSAIDs reduce inflammation by inhibiting the enzyme COX-1. Prednisone reduces inflammation by inhibiting arachidonic acid, a precursor to COX-1. tcmtests.com, July 2020",
      "exp_hant": "生物製劑透過抑制腫瘤壞死因子（TNF）來減輕發炎，因此被稱為TNF阻斷劑。這類藥物是以基因工程技術，利用人類或動物組織於實驗室製成的抗體，經由注射或皮下方式給藥。人體免疫系統會自然產生TNF並維持其穩定濃度，TNF可調控細胞死亡與發炎反應。在自體免疫疾病中，人體會產生過量TNF，進而啟動發炎過程。TNF阻斷劑的例子包括：1）Adalimumab（Humira）、infliximab（Rimicade，類克）及etanercept（Enbrel，恩博）用於治療類風濕性關節炎、乾癬性關節炎、克隆氏病、潰瘍性結腸炎及僵直性脊椎炎；2）rituximab（Rituxan，莫須瘤）用於治療非何杰金氏淋巴瘤及慢性淋巴性白血病；3）bevacizumab（Avastin，癌思停）用於治療乳癌、大腸直腸癌、腎癌、肺癌及卵巢癌；4）insulin glargine（Lantus，甘精胰島素）用於治療糖尿病。生物製劑常見副作用包括呼吸急促及畏寒，也會因改變免疫系統運作方式而使患者較易受感染。本題其他選項則是其他同樣具消炎作用之藥物類別的作用機轉：免疫抑制劑會阻斷細胞嘌呤合成。嘌呤是合成細胞DNA/RNA所需的物質，藉由抑制嘌呤合成，減少白血球合成所需的DNA/RNA，進而造成免疫抑制以減輕發炎，藥物例子包括azathioprine（硫唑嘌呤，Imuran、Azasan）及mercaptopurine（巰基嘌呤，Purinethol），用於治療類風濕性關節炎、克隆氏病及潰瘍性結腸炎。非類固醇消炎藥（NSAIDs）藉由抑制COX-1酵素來減輕發炎。Prednisone（普賴松）則藉由抑制COX-1的前驅物花生四烯酸來減輕發炎。tcmtests.com，2020年7月"
