      "exp_en": "Sodium ascorbate is buffered vitamin C. Vitamin C is often combined with echinacea preparations. Rooibos tea is naturally caffeine-free and is an alternative to black or green tea. THERAPEUTIC: Echinacea has a mild benefit in preventing the common cold. Taking echinacea after catching a cold seems to not have much benefit. CONTRAINDICATIONS: Echinacea is safe for most patients in the short-term. Avoid coffee, tea, cola, energy drinks, or other products that contain caffeine. Side effects can include fever, nausea, sore throat, dry mouth, headache, dizziness, and tongue numbness. DRUG INTERACTIONS: Echinacea can slow down the breaking down of caffeine. The combination can result in too much caffeine in the body (restlessness, headache, rapid heart beat). Since echinacea can tonify the immune system, concurrent use would work at cross purpose with drugs that decrease the immune system response (corticosteroids, immunosuppressants) to treat autoimmune disorders Echinacea slows the break down of certain drugs (antipsychotics, tricyclic antidepressants, theophylline antiasthmatics) in the liver and this can result in the increased effect and side effects of these drugs. www.webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "抗壞血酸鈉是一種緩衝型維生素C，維生素C常與紫錐花製劑併用。南非國寶茶天然不含咖啡因，是紅茶或綠茶的替代選擇。【治療用途】紫錐花對預防普通感冒有輕微效果，但感冒後才服用紫錐花似乎效果不大。【禁忌】紫錐花對大多數患者短期使用是安全的，但應避免與咖啡、茶、可樂、能量飲料或其他含咖啡因的產品併用，其副作用可能包括發燒、噁心、喉嚨痛、口乾、頭痛、頭暈及舌頭麻木。【藥物交互作用】紫錐花會減緩咖啡因的分解，兩者併用可能導致體內咖啡因過量（躁動、頭痛、心跳加快）。由於紫錐花能增強免疫系統，若與用於治療自體免疫疾病、可降低免疫反應的藥物（皮質類固醇、免疫抑制劑）併用，會產生相反的作用效果。紫錐花會減緩肝臟分解某些藥物（抗精神病藥、三環抗憂鬱藥、茶鹼類氣喘藥）的速度，進而增強這些藥物的效果與副作用。www.webmd.com"
    },
