      "exp_en": "Wild yam contains the component diosgenin which can be made into steroids (estrogen, DHEA). Wild yam can have some estrogen-like and DHEA-like effects but it is not actually converted into estrogen or DHEA in the body. This can only be done in the laboratory. THERAPEUTIC: Applying wild yam cream topically for 3 months may relieve menopausal symptoms (hot flashes, night sweats). CONTRAINDICATIONS: Since wild yam can act like an estrogen, hormone-sensitive conditions (breast cancer, uterine cancer, ovarian cancer, endometriosis) might worsen the condition. DRUG INTERACTIONS: Estrogens or any drugs containing estrogen. www.webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "山藥含有一種成分薯蕷皂苷（diosgenin），可被製成類固醇（如雌激素、DHEA）。山藥可能具有類似雌激素及DHEA的作用，但實際上並不會在人體內轉化為雌激素或DHEA，此過程僅能在實驗室中完成。【治療用途】局部塗抹山藥乳膏3個月可能有助於緩解更年期症狀（如潮熱、夜間盜汗）。【禁忌】由於山藥可能具有類似雌激素的作用，對荷爾蒙敏感的疾病（如乳癌、子宮癌、卵巢癌、子宮內膜異位症）可能因此惡化。【藥物交互作用】雌激素或任何含雌激素的藥物。www.webmd.com"
