      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. THERAPEUTIC: Choline may decrease asthmatic symptoms and may reduce bronchodilator use. Choline can prevent neural tube defects in the growing fetus. Many patients take choline for cognitive function symptoms in Alzheimer's disease and dementia because the body uses choline to produce the neurotransmitter acetylcholine but current research is inconclusive. Many athletes take choline to improve athletic performance to delay fatigue and improve endurance but current research is inconclusive. Many patients take choline to improve liver health but current research is inconclusive. CONTRAINDICATIONS: Choline is likely safe during pregnancy but there is no data for use during breast-feeding. When there is an uncertainty about the use of a supplement, it is best to avoid it during breast-feeding. Common side effects can include sweating, a fishy body odor, and GI distress. DRUG INTERACTIONS: Choline is not known to interact with any drugs. www.webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且最正確的答案。【治療用途】膽鹼可能減輕氣喘症狀，並減少支氣管擴張劑的使用量；膽鹼可預防生長中胎兒的神經管缺陷。許多患者服用膽鹼以改善阿茲海默症及失智症的認知功能症狀，因為人體會利用膽鹼來合成神經傳導物質乙醯膽鹼，但目前研究尚無定論。許多運動員服用膽鹼以提升運動表現、延緩疲勞並增強耐力，但目前研究同樣尚無定論。許多患者服用膽鹼以改善肝臟健康，但研究亦無定論。【禁忌】膽鹼在懷孕期間可能是安全的，但哺乳期間的相關資料闕如。當對某項保健品的使用存在不確定性時，最好在哺乳期間避免使用。常見副作用可能包括出汗、體味帶魚腥味及腸胃不適。【藥物交互作用】目前尚未發現膽鹼與任何藥物產生交互作用。www.webmd.com"
