      "exp_en": "THERAPEUTIC: Daily intake of panax ginseng may increase cognitive ability in patients with Alzheimer's disease. It can also increase abstract thinking and reaction time in healthy middle-aged patients but not in young adults. Panax ginseng can improve respiratory symptoms in patients with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD). Panax ginseng can improve sexual function in male patients with erectile dysfunction (ED). Panax ginseng can treat the fatigue and tiredness associated with multiple sclerosis. CONTRAINDICATIONS: One of the chemicals in Panax ginseng can cause birth defects in animal research. Panax ginseng is contraindicated during pregnancy. Panax ginseng can increase immune system activity and can worsen auto-immune diseases. High doses of panax ginseng can cause insomnia and should be avoided by patients with sleeping problems. Common side effect includes insomnia. Less common effects include menstrual symptoms, breast pain, increased heart rate, and high or low blood pressure. DRUG INTERACTIONS: Panax ginseng may decrease blood sugar levels. Concurrent use with insulin may lower the blood sugar too much. Panax ginseng increases the immune system. Concurrent use with immune suppressing drugs might decrease their effectiveness. Panax ginseng might slow blood clotting. Concurrent use with anticoagulants might increase the risk of bleeding and bruising. Panax ginseng can stimulate the nervous system. Concurrent with stimulant drugs may increase heart rate and blood pressure. Panax ginseng interacts with alcohol by speeding up how fast the body breaks down alcohol. Concurrent use of panax ginseng and caffeine can increase heart rate and blood pressure. www.webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "【治療用途】每日服用西洋參可能提升阿茲海默症患者的認知能力，也可能提升健康中年患者（而非年輕成人）的抽象思考能力與反應時間。西洋參可改善慢性阻塞性肺病（COPD）患者的呼吸道症狀，也可改善男性勃起功能障礙（ED）患者的性功能，並可治療多發性硬化症相關的疲勞與倦怠感。【禁忌】動物實驗顯示，西洋參中的某種化學成分可能導致出生缺陷，因此懷孕期間禁忌使用西洋參。西洋參可能增強免疫系統活性，進而加重自體免疫疾病。高劑量西洋參可能引起失眠，有睡眠問題的患者應避免使用，常見副作用為失眠，較少見的影響包括月經症狀、乳房疼痛、心跳加快，以及血壓過高或過低。【藥物交互作用】西洋參可能降低血糖濃度，與胰島素併用可能使血糖降得過低。西洋參會增強免疫系統，與免疫抑制藥物併用可能降低其療效。西洋參可能減緩血液凝固，與抗凝血劑併用可能增加出血與瘀傷的風險。西洋參可刺激神經系統，與興奮劑類藥物併用可能增加心跳與血壓。西洋參與酒精之間的交互作用，是加快人體分解酒精的速度；西洋參與咖啡因併用則可能增加心跳與血壓。www.webmd.com"
