    {
      "number": 763,
      "question_en": "In insomnia caused by a Circadian Rhythm Sleep Disorders, which one applies to \"night owls\"?",
      "question_hant": "在因生理時鐘睡眠障礙（Circadian Rhythm Sleep Disorders）引起的失眠中，下列何者適用於「夜貓族」？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "delayed sleep disorder",
          "hant": "睡眠期後移症候群（delayed sleep disorder）",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "advanced sleep disorder",
          "hant": "睡眠期前移症候群（advanced sleep disorder）",
