      "number": 770,
      "question_en": "Which of the following is a mnemonic used to evaluate red flag headache cases?",
      "question_hant": "下列何者是用於評估危險徵象頭痛病例的助記法（mnemonic）？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "SOAP",
          "hant": "SOAP",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "10 S's",
          "hant": "10 S's",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "SNOOP",
          "hant": "SNOOP",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "SAD REP",
          "hant": "SAD REP",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Red flag headache symptoms-signs point to the potential presence of a serious underlying disorder. The SNOOP mnemonic is a handy reference in helping to evaluate red flags. S = Systemic Symptoms (fever, persistent vomiting, stiff neck, pregnancy, cancer, immunocompromised, etc.). N = Neurological Signs-Symptoms (altered mentation, seizures, impairment of nerve, spinal cord, or brain function, optic disc swelling caused by increased intracranial pressure, limb weakness or numbness, etc.). O = Onset is New or Sudden (especially in patients over 40 years or older describe their headache as their first or worst headache). O = Other Associated Conditions (headache from head trauma, headache worse from Valsalva maneuvers, headaches awakens patient, etc.). P = Prior Headache History that is Different (headaches now in new location, with a different pattern, or rapidly worsening in severity or frequency, etc.). When these symptoms-signs are present the patient needs to be referred to investigate the secondary cause of headaches.",
      "exp_hant": "危險徵象頭痛的症狀與徵象，提示可能存在嚴重的潛在疾病。SNOOP助記法是協助評估危險徵象的實用參考。S＝全身性症狀（Systemic Symptoms，如發燒、持續嘔吐、頸部僵硬、懷孕、癌症、免疫功能低下等）。N＝神經學徵象與症狀（Neurological Signs-Symptoms，如意識狀態改變、癲癇發作、神經／脊髓／腦部功能受損、因顱內壓升高造成的視神經盤水腫、肢體無力或麻木等）。O＝發作為新發或突然（Onset is New or Sudden，尤其40歲以上患者描述其頭痛為生平第一次或最嚴重的一次）。O＝其他相關情況（Other Associated Conditions，如頭部外傷後頭痛、瓦氏操作使頭痛加劇、頭痛使患者從睡夢中痛醒等）。P＝先前頭痛病史出現改變（Prior Headache History that is Different，如頭痛出現於新的部位、型態改變，或嚴重度、頻率快速惡化等）。當出現上述症狀與徵象時，患者需要轉診以進一步調查頭痛的次發性病因。"
    },
