      "exp_en": "Angina pectoris, commonly known as angina, is chest pain due to ischemia or a lack of oxygenated blood to the heart muscle, generally due to obstruction or spasm of the coronary arteries. There are two types of angina: stable and unstable. stable angina has worsening chest pain after activity and improves with rest. Unstable angina is chest pain that occurs even during rest. tcmtests.com, July 2020",
      "exp_hant": "心絞痛（angina pectoris），俗稱絞痛，是因心肌缺血、含氧血液供應不足所引起的胸痛，通常是由冠狀動脈阻塞或痙攣所導致。心絞痛分為兩種類型：穩定型與不穩定型。穩定型心絞痛在活動後胸痛加劇，休息後可緩解；不穩定型心絞痛則即使在休息時也會發作。tcmtests.com，2020年7月"
