    {
      "number": 773,
      "question_en": "A 55 year-old female has swelling between the toes with tingling and numbness of both feet. When standing and walking she has stinging pain between the toes. She says that it feels \"like a small pebble\" is under the ball of the foot. What is the most likely diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一位55歲女性雙腳趾間腫脹，伴有雙腳刺痛與麻木感。站立與行走時，她的腳趾間會出現刺痛。她表示感覺「腳掌前部下方好像有一顆小石子」。最可能的診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "bone spurs",
          "hant": "骨刺",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "plantar fasciitis",
          "hant": "足底筋膜炎",
          "correct": false
