      "number": 776,
      "question_en": "A 55 year-old female patient requested acupuncture treatment for back pain. During the interview she noted that she has always had back pain when she had her period. Her last period was three years ago but she thinks she might have had some vaginal bleeding. She did not take any HRT (hormone replacement therapy) for her menopause. The physical examination of her back and abdomen were normal. Which action would you take?",
      "question_hant": "一位55歲女性患者因背痛前來要求針灸治療。問診時她提到，過去月經來潮時一向會有背痛。她的末次月經是三年前，但她認為近期可能曾有少量陰道出血。她停經後未服用荷爾蒙補充療法（HRT）。背部與腹部理學檢查皆正常。您會採取下列何種行動？",
