      "exp_en": "Cigarette smoking is a known risk factor for cardiovascular disease. Smoking causes an immediate spike in blood pressure and can raise systolic blood pressure levels. The nicotine causes the nervous system to release chemicals that constrict blood vessels and contribute to high blood pressure. Smoking also causes long-term damage to blood vessels, so beyond the hypertension risk, this habit further increases the chance of developing problems like stroke, heart disease, and heart attack. tcmtests.com, July 2020",
      "exp_hant": "吸菸是已知的心血管疾病危險因子。吸菸會立即使血壓飆升，並可能提高收縮壓。尼古丁會促使神經系統釋放使血管收縮的化學物質，進而導致高血壓。吸菸也會對血管造成長期損傷，因此除了增加高血壓風險外，這個習慣還會進一步提高中風、心臟病與心肌梗塞的發生機率。tcmtests.com，2020年7月"
