      "number": 778,
      "question_en": "A 24 year-old woman has a cheesy white vaginal discharge, vulvar pruritis, and experiences dyspareunia. Vaginal pH is 4.0. A wet mount shows the presence of budding hyphea. What is the most likely diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一位24歲女性有乳酪狀白色陰道分泌物、外陰搔癢，並有性交疼痛。陰道pH值為4.0。濕式抹片顯示有出芽性菌絲（budding hyphae）存在。最可能的診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
