      "exp_en": "Candidiasis is a fungal infection caused by yeasts. Common symptoms are thick, white,\"cottage cheese\" like vaginal discharge that stick to the vaginal wall, vaginal vulvar pruritus and burning, and dyspareunia (painful intercourse). Symptoms and signs worsen the week before menses. A sample of the vaginal discharge is checked for the presence of bacteria, fungus, or white blood cells. This is done with a vaginal wet mount, also called vaginal smear or wet prep, where the vaginal secretions are smeared on a glass slide with a salt solution and then examined under a microscope. In candidal vaginitis the wet mount will show the presence of mycella (fungus) in the form of a long, branching filamentous structure called budding hyphea. Normal vaginal pH is 4.5. Antifungal drugs (oral fluconazole) are prescribed. Differential Diagnosis, Rhoads, 2015 page 284-288",
      "exp_hant": "念珠菌病是由酵母菌引起的黴菌感染。常見症狀包括濃稠、白色、如「白色乳酪狀」並黏附於陰道壁的分泌物、外陰搔癢與灼熱感，以及性交疼痛。症狀通常在經前一週加劇。可採集陰道分泌物檢體，檢查是否有細菌、黴菌或白血球，此方法稱為陰道濕式抹片（亦稱陰道塗片或濕式檢查），將陰道分泌物與生理食鹽水混合塗抹於玻片上，於顯微鏡下觀察。念珠菌性陰道炎的濕式抹片會顯示出芽性菌絲（budding hyphae），呈長條分枝狀的絲狀結構。正常陰道pH值為4.5。治療上會使用抗黴菌藥物（口服氟康唑）。《鑑別診斷》，Rhoads著，2015年，頁284-288"
    },
    {
      "number": 779,
      "question_en": "A pregnant patient has headaches. She has blurred vision and sees spots of light. She complains of rapid weight gain and says she feels puffed up in her face and arms. She also complains of nausea and vomiting. She denies having any convulsions. What is the most likely type of headache?",
      "question_hant": "一位孕婦有頭痛症狀，並有視力模糊、眼前出現閃光點。她主訴體重快速增加，並感覺臉部與手臂浮腫。她也有噁心與嘔吐的症狀，但否認有抽搐。最可能的頭痛類型為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "migraine headache",
          "hant": "偏頭痛",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "pre-eclampsia headache",
          "hant": "子癲前症頭痛",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Tension headache",
          "hant": "緊張性頭痛",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Thunderclap headache",
          "hant": "雷擊樣頭痛",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Pre-eclampsia is also called toxemia of pregnancy. Pre-eclampsia and eclampsia are high blood pressure that occur during pregnancy. They are both associated with protein in the urine and edema. Eclampsia is the same as pre-eclampsia except that the former has seizures. The first sign of pre-eclampsia that is noticed is rapid weight gain (2-5 pounds in one week). Edema in the legs is common in pregnancy. However, in pre-eclampsia there is edema in the face and arms. If the pre-eclampsia progresses there can be additional symptoms of severity such as headaches, vision changes, and abdominal pain. Symptoms of pre-eclampsia include rapid weight gain, edema in the face and arms, headache, vision changes, dizziness, tinnitus, abdominal pain, decrease urination, and nausea-vomiting. Increasing blood pressure can impact the kidneys (protein in the urine), destroy red blood cells (anemia), impact liver functioning, and decrease platelet count (excess bleeding with delivery or spontaneous bleeding). As the blood pressure continues to rise there can be seizures which is an emergency situation as the mother and baby are at risk of oxygen deprivation. In eclampsia, the high blood pressure can make the placenta separate from the uterus (abruptio placentae) which can cause severe bleeding and possible death of the fetus and the mother.",
      "exp_hant": "子癲前症（pre-eclampsia）又稱妊娠毒血症。子癲前症與子癲症都是懷孕期間出現的高血壓，兩者皆伴有蛋白尿與水腫。子癲症與子癲前症相同，差別在於子癲症會出現抽搐。子癲前症最早被注意到的徵象是體重快速增加（一週內增加2至5磅）。懷孕期間下肢水腫很常見，但子癲前症會出現臉部與手臂的水腫。若子癲前症持續惡化，可能出現頭痛、視力改變與腹痛等較嚴重的症狀。子癲前症的症狀包括體重快速增加、臉部與手臂水腫、頭痛、視力改變、頭暈、耳鳴、腹痛、排尿減少及噁心嘔吐。血壓持續升高會影響腎臟（造成蛋白尿）、破壞紅血球（造成貧血）、影響肝臟功能，並降低血小板數量（導致分娩時出血過多或自發性出血）。若血壓持續升高，可能出現抽搐，這是緊急狀況，因為母親與胎兒皆有缺氧的風險。在子癲症中，高血壓可能使胎盤自子宮剝離（胎盤早期剝離），導致嚴重出血，甚至可能造成胎兒與母親死亡。"
