    {
      "number": 786,
      "question_en": "Which of the following is an accurate comparison between a myocardial infarction (MI) and gastroesophageal reflux disease (GERD)?",
      "question_hant": "下列關於心肌梗塞（MI）與胃食道逆流疾病（GERD）的比較，何者正確？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
