          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "an MI can have vomiting and GERD can have a a feeling of choking",
          "hant": "心肌梗塞可能出現嘔吐，而胃食道逆流可能出現哽塞感",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "troponins are detected in GERD and myoglobins are detected in an MI",
          "hant": "肌鈣蛋白可在胃食道逆流中檢測到，肌紅蛋白可在心肌梗塞中檢測到",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "both always have chest pain that moves toward the shoulders and arms",
          "hant": "兩者的胸痛都一定會擴散至肩膀與手臂",
