      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. Congestive heart failure is due to an impaired heart pumping function. Congestive heart failure can be divided into systolic or diastolic heart failure. In systolic heart failure the heart does not contract enough. In diastolic heart failure there is impaired cardiac relaxation and abnormal ventricular blood filling. About 60% of patients with congestive heart failure have systolic heart failure which is the result of the end stage of coronary artery disease. Calcium channel blockers may be used to treat heart failure caused by high blood pressure but are not used with congestive heart failure due to systolic dysfunction. ACE inhibitors block angiotensin II formation which is a hormone that adversely affects the heart and blood circulation in heart failure patients. Beta-blockers improve heart function in congestive heart failure patients who are already taking ACE inhibitors. Diuretics are prescribed to alleviate fluid retention in the lungs and extremities. Digoxin (Lanoxin), a drug that has been use for hundreds of years, can also be prescribed to make the heart pump more strongly. Life style changes include sodium and fluid control, aerobic exercises. The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page 652",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且正確的答案。鬱血性心臟衰竭是心臟泵血功能受損所致，可分為收縮性心臟衰竭與舒張性心臟衰竭。收縮性心臟衰竭是心臟收縮力不足；舒張性心臟衰竭則是心臟舒張功能受損，導致心室充盈異常。約有60%的鬱血性心臟衰竭患者屬於收縮性心臟衰竭，多為冠狀動脈疾病末期的結果。鈣離子通道阻斷劑可用於治療因高血壓引起的心臟衰竭，但不用於因收縮功能障礙導致的鬱血性心臟衰竭。ACE抑制劑可阻斷血管收縮素II的形成，此荷爾蒙會對心臟衰竭患者的心臟與血液循環造成不良影響。乙型阻斷劑則可改善已服用ACE抑制劑的鬱血性心臟衰竭患者的心臟功能。利尿劑用於緩解肺部與四肢的體液滯留。毛地黃（Digoxin，商品名Lanoxin）是使用已有數百年歷史的藥物，也可用於增強心臟的收縮力。生活型態調整包括控制鈉與水分攝取、進行有氧運動。《默克診療手冊》，第18版，頁652"
