      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. Antibiotics are not prescribed to alleviate asthma symptoms. Asthma has no cure. The goal of asthma treatment is controlling symptoms of the disease. Asthma patients required quick acting medicines to relieve acute asthma flare ups. Bronchodilators (short-acting beta2-agonists) are the first line drug prescription. Inhaled corticosteroids are the preferred medicine for long-term control the inflammation associated with asthma. Mast cell stabilizers prevent mast cells from releasing the inflammatory substances (histamine, Interleukin, proteoglycans). In the long term, this can reduce asthma symptoms. A doctor referral should be done if the patient's medicine does not control an asthma attack. 911 should be called if the patient has difficulty talking or walking because of insufficient breath or the fingernails or lips become blue. The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page 387",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且正確的答案。抗生素並非用於緩解氣喘症狀的藥物。氣喘目前尚無法治癒，治療目標在於控制疾病症狀。氣喘患者需要快速作用的藥物來緩解急性發作。支氣管擴張劑（短效乙二型交感神經促效劑）是第一線用藥。吸入型皮質類固醇則是長期控制氣喘相關發炎反應的首選藥物。肥大細胞穩定劑可防止肥大細胞釋放發炎物質（組織胺、介白素、蛋白多醣），長期使用有助於減少氣喘症狀。若患者的藥物無法控制氣喘發作，應轉診就醫；若患者因呼吸不足而說話或行走困難，或指甲、嘴唇發紺，則應撥打911。《默克診療手冊》，第18版，頁387"
    },
    {
      "number": 804,
      "question_en": "A 20 year-old female patient came to the clinic with her mother. The mother is very concerned about the number of days her daughter has missed from schools during the year. She has missed 1-2 days almost every month because of her painful period. Her menarche occurred at age 12 1/2. Her period is around the beginning of each month and lasts for five days. She uses five tampons during her heaviest days and fewer on day 4 and 5. Her cramps begin the day before her period and last until day two of her menses. She sometimes also experiences nausea and sometimes vomiting. The last normal period was one week ago. She denies any urinary frequency, urgency, dysuria, hematuria, vaginal discharge, pruritis, pain with sex, or lower abdominal pain other than during her period. She is 62 inches tall, weighs 100 pounds, has a BP of 100/70, and HR of 60, and a RR of 12. Genital examination is normal with pale and pink mucosa, no lymphadenopathy, discharge, or odor. What is the most likely diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一位20歲女性患者由母親陪同前來就診。母親非常擔心女兒這一年來因病缺課的天數，她幾乎每個月都會因經痛而缺課1至2天。她初經發生於12歲半，月經約在每月月初來潮，持續五天。經血量最多的那幾天需使用五片衛生棉條，第四、五天使用量較少。她的經痛從月經來潮前一天開始，持續到經期第二天，有時也會伴隨噁心，偶爾嘔吐。上一次正常月經是一週前。她否認有頻尿、尿急、排尿疼痛、血尿、陰道分泌物、搔癢、性交疼痛，或月經期間以外的下腹疼痛。她身高62吋，體重100磅，血壓100/70，心率每分鐘60下，呼吸速率每分鐘12次。生殖器檢查正常，黏膜呈淡粉紅色，無淋巴結腫大、分泌物或異味。最可能的診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "secondary dysmenorrhea",
