          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Serum uric acid, joint aspiration and fluid exam",
          "hant": "血清尿酸、關節抽吸與關節液檢查",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This patient has gout. Synovial fluid can be drawn from a painful joint or bursa during a joint aspiration. An analysis of the synovial fluid can help to diagnose gout, rheumatoid arthritis, or an infection. The serum uric acid level tests for uric acid levels to help diagnose gout. Gout is a type of arthritis that is characterized as having acute and severe pain (usually in the morning), redness, swelling, and warmth in joints, usually the big toe. The cause of gout is deposits of uric acid crystals in the joints. Uric acid crystals can also form as stones in the kidneys. Some foods (red meats, internal organs such as liver and kidneys, shellfish, anchovies) contain a lot of uric acid. Patients who eat a lot of these types of food or drink beer/liquor in excess can get gout. Gout is diagnosed not from a blood test but from withdrawing and analyzing fluid from the affected and inflamed joint. Gout is usually treated with diet, NSAIDs, and corticosteroids. If untreated gout, can lead to joint damage. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, page 238, 709",
      "exp_hant": "此患者罹患痛風。可透過關節抽吸從疼痛的關節或滑液囊中抽取滑液，分析滑液有助於診斷痛風、類風濕性關節炎或感染。血清尿酸值檢測可協助診斷痛風。痛風是一種關節炎，特徵為關節（通常是大拇趾）出現急性劇痛（通常於早晨發作）、發紅、腫脹與發熱。痛風的成因是尿酸結晶沉積於關節內，尿酸結晶也可能在腎臟中形成結石。某些食物（紅肉、肝臟與腎臟等內臟、貝殼類海鮮、鯷魚）含有大量尿酸，攝取大量此類食物或過度飲用啤酒／烈酒的患者容易罹患痛風。痛風的診斷並非依靠血液檢查，而是透過抽取並分析患處發炎關節的關節液來確診。痛風通常以飲食調整、非類固醇消炎藥（NSAIDs）與皮質類固醇治療。若痛風未經治療，可能導致關節損傷。《生物醫學：針灸與東方醫學從業者教科書》，Robinson著，2007年，頁238、709"
    },
    {
      "number": 806,
      "question_en": "A 66 year-old female patient complains of having upper midback pain which began after lifting her three-year old granddaughter over her head four days ago. Her granddaughter weighs 25 pounds. She reports that she has lifted her many times before without a problem. She describes the pain as a sharp constant pain radiating to her lower chest and around her abdomen. The pain intensity as +5/10 and improving after resting. She reports that Tylenol or aspirin do not help. She reports having difficulty breathing due to the pain. She denies depression and problems with concentration and memory. She denies headaches, coughs, and heartburn. She describes the pain as different than the morning stiffness of her rheumatoid arthritis (RA). She reports having some urinary urgency and leakage, especially when laughing. She reports good sleep and waking up refreshed. She denies any previous chest pain, palpitations, or dyspnea on exertion. She denies any numbness, tingling, fainting, or dizziness. She has a history of RA controlled with oral steroids and hypertension controlled with HCTZ. Vital signs: BP 130/78; P 74; RR 30; weight 130 lbs; height 5 ft 5 inches; BMI 21.6. Heart is without murmurs, rubs, or gallops. She has chest pain when her chest is manually compressed. The thoracic spine has limited ROM due to pain, with tenderness at T7 and T8. What is the most likely diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一位66歲女性患者主訴上背中段疼痛，於四天前將三歲孫女高舉過頭後開始出現，孫女體重25磅。她表示過去也多次抱過孫女，未曾有任何問題。她描述疼痛為尖銳且持續，並放射至下胸部與腹部周圍，疼痛強度為+5/10，休息後有改善。她表示泰諾或阿斯匹靈皆無效。她表示因疼痛而呼吸困難。她否認憂鬱及注意力與記憶方面的問題。她否認頭痛、咳嗽與火燒心。她表示此疼痛與她類風濕性關節炎（RA）的晨僵不同。她表示有輕微尿急與漏尿，尤其在大笑時更明顯。她表示睡眠良好，醒來時感覺神清氣爽。她否認過去有胸痛、心悸或運動時呼吸困難。她否認麻木、刺痛、昏厥或頭暈。她有以口服類固醇控制的類風濕性關節炎病史，以及以HCTZ控制的高血壓病史。生命徵象：血壓130/78；脈搏74；呼吸速率30；體重130磅；身高5呎5吋；BMI 21.6。心臟聽診無雜音、摩擦音或奔馬音。當胸部受到人工壓迫時，她會感到胸痛。胸椎因疼痛而活動範圍受限，第七與第八胸椎有壓痛。最可能的診斷為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "atypical angina",
          "hant": "非典型心絞痛",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "vertebral compression fracture",
          "hant": "脊椎壓迫性骨折",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "RA flare up",
          "hant": "類風濕性關節炎急性發作",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "herniated cervical disc",
          "hant": "頸椎椎間盤突出",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The most common differential diagnosis for a midlife woman with acute upper midback pain that limits ROM and deep breathing with pain radiating to her lower chest and abdomen is a vertebral compression fracture (VCF) due to osteoporosis (OP). Most patients who present with VCF do not have significant pain but do have height loss or kyphosis. OP often presents with a fracture because there are no symptoms associated with with bone loss. OP is diagnosed via history and bone density measurement with DXA (Dual X-ray Absorptiometry). Because of her age, angina should be evaluated because she is at an increased risk of cardiac problems (though not common) arising from the rheumatoid arthritis (RA). Plus, being menopausal increases cardiovascular risk. Atypical angina is not associated with the classical symptoms such as squeezing/pressure of the chest, SOB, sweating, dizziness. In atypical angina there is generalized and severe fatigue, excess breathing and sweating with feeling faint, nausea, sleep disturbances, dizziness, shoulder/back/jaw pain, and palpitations. The RA is a less likely cause of her pain. RA flare ups tend to manifest with increased symptoms in previously affected joints such as the finger joints. A herniated cervical disc presents with pain, numbness and tingling, which she denies. Clinical Case Studies for the Family Nurse Practitioner, Leslie Neal-Boylan, 2011, page 330-335",
      "exp_hant": "對於一位中年女性出現急性上背中段疼痛，並限制活動範圍與深呼吸，疼痛放射至下胸部與腹部，最常見的鑑別診斷為因骨質疏鬆症（OP）所導致的脊椎壓迫性骨折（VCF）。大多數出現VCF的患者並無明顯疼痛，但會有身高減少或駝背的表現。骨質疏鬆症常常是因骨折而被發現，因為骨質流失本身並無相關症狀。骨質疏鬆症的診斷依據病史與雙能X光吸收測定（DXA）骨密度檢測。由於此患者的年齡，加上類風濕性關節炎可能（雖不常見）增加心臟問題的風險，應評估是否為心絞痛，且停經也會增加心血管風險。非典型心絞痛並不會出現典型症狀，如胸部擠壓感／壓迫感、呼吸急促、盜汗、頭暈；非典型心絞痛的表現則是全身性且嚴重的疲勞、呼吸與盜汗增加並感覺快要暈倒、噁心、睡眠障礙、頭暈、肩／背／下顎疼痛，以及心悸。類風濕性關節炎較不可能是造成此疼痛的原因，因為類風濕性關節炎急性發作通常表現為先前已受影響的關節（如手指關節）症狀加劇。頸椎椎間盤突出則會出現疼痛、麻木與刺痛，而此患者否認有這些症狀。《家庭護理師臨床病例研究》，Leslie Neal-Boylan著，2011年，頁330-335"
    },
