      "exp_en": "He most likely has cirrhosis of the liver. Cirrhosis is a late stage fibrosis (scarring) of the liver. Cirrhosis is caused by different types of liver diseases (hepatitis, fatty liver) and conditions (chronic alcoholism). The scarring eventually prevents the liver from functioning properly. The scar tissue blocks liver blood flow and slows down its processing of hormones, nutrients, drugs, and naturally produced body toxins. Symptoms of cirrhosis include poor appetite, fatigue, weight loss or sudden weight gain, bruises, jaundice, itchy skin, edema (ankles, legs, abdomen), urine with an orange tint, light colored stools, blood in stool, confusion, and personality changes. Biomedicine: A Textbook for Practitioners of Acupuncture and Oriental Medicine, 2007, Robinson, pages 645, 715",
      "exp_hant": "此患者最可能罹患肝硬化。肝硬化是肝臟晚期纖維化（疤痕化）的結果，可由多種肝臟疾病（肝炎、脂肪肝）及其他病況（慢性酗酒）所引起。疤痕組織最終會使肝臟無法正常運作，並阻礙肝臟血流，減緩其處理荷爾蒙、營養素、藥物與體內自然產生毒素的能力。肝硬化的症狀包括食慾不振、疲勞、體重減輕或突然增加、瘀傷、黃疸、皮膚搔癢、水腫（腳踝、腿部、腹部）、尿液呈橘色、糞便顏色變淺、血便、意識混亂與性格改變。《生物醫學：針灸與東方醫學從業者教科書》，Robinson著，2007年，頁645、715"
