      "exp_en": "The red flag is neck pain with tingling, numbness or pain radiating down one arm. Cervical nerve root radiculopathy is assumed present until proven otherwise. The type of referral depends on the grade of severity. GRADE 1: neck mildly painful with intermittent paresthesia of shoulder, arm, and hand. There is no sensory, motor, or reflex issues. Sensory fibers are minimally compressed with no motor fiber compression. Immediate referral is not necessary. Treat patient, evaluate progress and if condition worsens then refer. GRADE 2: moderate neck pain with constant paresthesia, verifiable sensory loss in shoulder, arm, and/or hand. Sensory fibers are extremely compressed and motor fibers are not significantly compressed. Treat patient aggressively and refer for evaluation and possible co-treatment with the patient's physician. GRADE 3: neck is very painful with constant numbness, weakness, and reflex loss in arm and/or hand. No atrophy. Sensory fibers are extremely compressed and motor fibers are mildly compressed. Treat aggressively with semi-urgent referral to their primary care physician or neurosurgeon if their PCP is not available. GRADE 4: severe neck pain and paresthesia with muscle weakness and shoulder, arm, and/or hand muscle atrophy. Major compression of sensory and motor fibers. Acupuncture treatment should not delay a semi-urgent referral.An Acupuncturist's Guide to Medical Red Flags and Referrals, 2012, Anzaldua, pages 127-128",
      "exp_hant": "此案例的紅旗警訊為頸痛並伴有放射至單側手臂的刺痛、麻木或疼痛，應假定為頸神經根神經根病變，直到排除為止。轉診的類型取決於嚴重程度分級。第一級：頸部輕度疼痛，伴有肩、臂、手間歇性感覺異常，無感覺、運動或反射方面的問題，感覺神經纖維僅受輕微壓迫，運動神經纖維未受壓迫，不需立即轉診，應治療患者並評估其進展，若病情惡化再行轉診。第二級：頸部中度疼痛，伴有持續性感覺異常，肩、臂與／或手有可證實的感覺喪失，感覺神經纖維受到嚴重壓迫，運動神經纖維未受明顯壓迫，應積極治療患者，並轉診評估，可能需與患者的醫師共同治療。第三級：頸部非常疼痛，伴有持續性麻木、無力與反射喪失於手臂與／或手部，但無萎縮，感覺神經纖維受到嚴重壓迫，運動神經纖維受到輕度壓迫，應積極治療並半緊急轉診至基層照護醫師，若無法轉診則轉至神經外科醫師。第四級：頸部劇烈疼痛與感覺異常，伴有肌肉無力及肩、臂與／或手部肌肉萎縮，感覺與運動神經纖維皆受到嚴重壓迫，針灸治療不應延誤半緊急轉診。《針灸師醫療警訊與轉診指南》，2012年，Anzaldua著，頁127-128"
    },
