      "exp_en": "Pain starts in right abdomen, shift to back, and worsens with fatty meals are common symptoms of gallstones and is not considered an emergency situation. Fever, right lower abdomen pain with superficial and deep tenderness is possible appendicitis. Once appendicitis starts, there is no effective medical therapy. As such appendicitis is considered a medical emergency. When treated promptly, most patients recover without difficulty. If treatment is delayed, the appendix can burst, causing infection and even death. Unremitting sharp pain starts in back near the ribs and moves down toward the groin, fever could be due to kidney stone or bladder infection. 1) if the kidneys become obstructed from a kidney stone and there are bacteria in the kidney, then this bacteria can move into the blood stream. The first signs of this are fever or an elevated white blood count. This can lead to whole body sepsis and even death. 2) if a urinary tract infection spreads to the kidneys symptoms may include chills and shaking or night sweats, fever above 101 degrees Fahrenheit, and flank, back, or groin pain. Pregnant woman with vaginal bleeding that lasts more than one day may be due to an ectopic pregnancy or miscarriage. Abnormal vaginal bleeding is not typically life-threatening unless associated with a serious condition such as an ectopic pregnancy or miscarriage. Regardless of the trimester, women should be referred immediately if there is moderate to heavy vaginal bleeding or if the bleeding lasts longer than a day or if the bleeding is accompanied by other symptoms like abdominal pain, fever, chills, cramping or contractions. Women in the first trimester or second trimester who experience light bleeding or spotting that goes away within a few hours, a phone call to a doctor should be made that same day but is not considered an emergency.tcmtests.com, December 2019",
      "exp_hant": "疼痛始於右腹、轉移至背部，並於食用油膩食物後加劇，是膽結石的常見症狀，並非緊急狀況。發燒、右下腹疼痛並有淺層與深層壓痛，可能是闌尾炎。闌尾炎一旦發作，並無有效的藥物治療方式，因此被視為醫療緊急狀況；若能及時治療，多數患者可順利康復；若延誤治療，闌尾可能破裂，導致感染甚至死亡。持續性尖銳疼痛從背部肋骨附近開始，並向下延伸至腹股溝，伴有發燒，可能是腎結石或膀胱感染所致：1）若腎臟因腎結石而阻塞，且腎臟內有細菌，此細菌可能進入血流，最初的徵象是發燒或白血球數升高，可能導致全身性敗血症甚至死亡；2）若泌尿道感染擴散至腎臟，症狀可能包括發抖畏寒或夜間盜汗、體溫超過101°F，以及腰、背或腹股溝疼痛。孕婦陰道出血超過一天，可能是子宮外孕或流產所致。異常陰道出血通常不會危及生命，除非合併子宮外孕或流產等嚴重狀況。無論懷孕週數為何，若出現中度至大量陰道出血、出血持續超過一天，或伴隨腹痛、發燒、畏寒、痙攣或宮縮等其他症狀，都應立即轉診。若是懷孕初期或中期出現輕微出血或點狀出血，且在數小時內消退，則應於當天致電醫師，但不屬於緊急狀況。tcmtests.com，2019年12月"
