          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Slapping his face lightly",
          "hant": "輕拍他的臉部",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Shaking him and shouting",
          "hant": "搖晃他並大聲呼喊",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Sprinkling water on his face",
          "hant": "在他的臉上灑水",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Little babies respond to having the soles of their feet rubbed or tapped. For infants more than 2 months old, tap their shoulder or chest. In either case, call out their name in a loud voice. If the infant does not respond and is not breathing or only gasping then place the infant on their back on a firm surface. Stand or kneel next to the infant. Then give 30 chest compressions. Place the pad of two fingers on the center of the chest below the nipple line. Compress the chest 1.5 inches and then let the chest return to normal position. Tilt the head to a neutral position. Then give two rescue breaths by making a complete seal of the nose of the infant with your mouth. Take a normal breath and blow into the nose of the infant for about 1 second. Take another breath, make a seal, and then give a second rescue breath. Continue giving 30 chest compressions and 2 rescue breaths until you notice a sign of life, use an AED, or EMS arrives.First Aid/CPR/AED, Participant Manual, Red Cross, 2016, page 57-58",
      "exp_hant": "小嬰兒對輕拍或搓揉腳底會有反應。對於超過兩個月大的嬰兒，可輕拍其肩膀或胸部。無論哪種方式，都應同時大聲呼喚嬰兒的名字。若嬰兒沒有反應，且沒有呼吸或僅有喘息，應將嬰兒仰躺置於堅硬表面上。施救者站立或跪在嬰兒旁，先進行30次胸部按壓：將兩指的指腹放在乳頭連線下方的胸部中央，下壓約1.5吋後讓胸部回彈至原位。接著將頭部調整至中立位置，再給予兩次人工呼吸：以口完全包覆嬰兒的鼻子，正常吸一口氣後對著嬰兒的鼻子吹氣約1秒；再吸一口氣、重新密封後給予第二次人工呼吸。持續進行30次胸部按壓與2次人工呼吸的循環，直到發現生命徵象、可使用AED，或救護人員抵達為止。《急救／CPR／AED學員手冊》，紅十字會，2016年，頁57-58"
    },
    {
      "number": 827,
      "question_en": "A 6 year-old female child was brought to the clinic by her mother. The child had a sore throat. The child looked ill. The temperature was 103 degrees F. She did not talk and was drooling. She was making croup-like sounds when inhaling. There was no cyanosis. Which action would you take?",
      "question_hant": "一位6歲女童由母親帶至診所就診。這名女童喉嚨痛，看起來病懨懨的，體溫為103°F。她無法說話並且流口水，吸氣時發出類似哮吼的聲音，但沒有發紺。您會採取什麼行動？",
