      ],
      "exp_en": "The red flag is mid to lower abdominal colicky pain, vomiting, constipation, and abdominal distention. Bowel obstruction is assumed present until proven otherwise. This situation is an emergency and the patient should be sent to the nearest ED. If the patient is in shock or is in cardiopulmonary compromise, 911 should be called. Otherwise, a private transport with non-patient driver is OK. In small bowel obstruction pain comes first followed by vomiting, distention, and constipation. In large bowel obstruction, constipation is followed by distention, pain, and vomiting. In either case, persistent vomiting is a key feature of true bowel obstruction as opposed to bowel slowdown.An Acupuncturist's Guide to Medical Red Flags and Referrals, 2012, Anzaldua, pages 94-95",
      "exp_hant": "此案例的紅旗警訊為中至下腹絞痛、嘔吐、便秘與腹脹，應假定為腸阻塞，直到排除為止。此為緊急狀況，患者應被送往最近的急診室。若患者出現休克或心肺功能代償失調，應撥打911；否則可由非患者本人駕駛的私人交通工具送醫。小腸阻塞的表現順序通常是先疼痛，接著才出現嘔吐、腹脹與便秘；大腸阻塞則是先便秘，接著才出現腹脹、疼痛與嘔吐。無論哪一種，持續性嘔吐都是真正腸阻塞（相對於腸道蠕動遲緩）的關鍵特徵。《針灸師醫療警訊與轉診指南》，2012年，Anzaldua著，頁94-95"
    },
    {
      "number": 830,
      "question_en": "A 26 year-old female volleyball athlete complained of right shoulder pain. She thought she had a rotator cuff injury. She did a course of remedial exercises which did not improve the shoulder pain. She said that she recently noticed mild swelling in the hand and arm. The physical exam showed mild swelling of the right hand and arm. The ROM of the right shoulder was normal. The right radial pulse was normal. Which action would you take next for this patient?",
      "question_hant": "一位26歲女性排球運動員主訴右肩疼痛，她原以為是旋轉肌袖受傷。她進行了一系列復健運動，但肩部疼痛並未改善。她表示最近注意到右手與右臂有輕微腫脹。理學檢查顯示右手與右臂有輕微腫脹，右肩活動範圍正常，右側橈動脈搏動正常。您接下來會對此患者採取什麼行動？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
