        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "treat with acupuncture 1x per week for 5 weeks",
          "hant": "以針灸治療，每週一次，共五週",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The red flag is swelling of one arm with shoulder and/or axillary pain. Subclavian vein deep venous thrombosis (SVDVT) is assumed present until proven otherwise. SVDVT can occur in young athletes who use their arms a lot. In the early stages there are no symptoms or mild shoulder pain. In later stages, there is moderate arm swelling and pain which worsens with activity and improves with rest. Trauma patients with SVDVT have a history of neck and/or shoulder trauma. In SVDVT clot formation causes pressure in the distal veins of the arm and cause swelling. In this condition there are no changes in the pulses because this is a venous and not an arterial problem. In SVDVT, unlike DVT of the calf, there is no danger of a pulmonary embolus.An Acupuncturist's Guide to Medical Red Flags and Referrals, 2012, Anzaldua, pages 177-178",
      "exp_hant": "此案例的紅旗警訊為單側手臂腫脹並伴有肩部與／或腋窩疼痛，應假定為鎖骨下靜脈深部靜脈栓塞（SVDVT），直到排除為止。SVDVT可能發生於經常大量使用手臂的年輕運動員身上。早期可能沒有症狀或僅有輕微肩痛，晚期則會出現中度手臂腫脹與疼痛，活動時加劇、休息後緩解。有外傷病史的SVDVT患者通常有頸部與／或肩部外傷史。SVDVT是因血栓形成造成手臂遠端靜脈壓力升高而導致腫脹。此病況不會造成脈搏改變，因為這是靜脈而非動脈的問題。與小腿的DVT不同，SVDVT並無肺栓塞的風險。《針灸師醫療警訊與轉診指南》，2012年，Anzaldua著，頁177-178"
    },
    {
      "number": 831,
      "question_en": "A 48 year-old female patient had ankle swelling which began after a long plane ride. She had a similar problem in the past but this time the ankle swelling persisted for a longer period of time. She reported that the left calf felt full and looked red. The physical exam showed normal respirations and pulse. There is pitting edema in the right ankle and 2+ pitting edema of the left ankle and distal calf. The difference between the two ankles was 3.5 cm, with the left larger. Tenderness was elicited on the left calf with pressure. The skin color of the left calf was redder. She reported no chest pain nor shortness of breath. Which action would you take regarding this patient?",
      "question_hant": "一位48歲女性患者，長途飛行後出現腳踝腫脹。她過去曾有類似問題，但這次腳踝腫脹持續的時間更長。她表示左小腿感覺脹滿且外觀發紅。理學檢查顯示呼吸與脈搏正常。右腳踝有凹陷性水腫，左腳踝與遠端小腿有2+凹陷性水腫。兩側腳踝的差異為3.5公分，左側較大。按壓左小腿時可誘發壓痛，左小腿膚色較紅。她否認胸痛或呼吸急促。您會對此患者採取什麼行動？",
      "image": null,
