    {
      "number": 837,
      "question_en": "Which qualities would a skin growth need to have to qualify for a melanoma assessment referral?",
      "question_hant": "皮膚增生需要具備哪些特徵，才符合轉診進行黑色素瘤評估的條件？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
