        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "acrochordon, asymmetric, irregular border, more than one color, larger than 1 centimeter",
          "hant": "軟纖維瘤（皮膚贅疣）、不對稱、邊緣不規則、顏色不只一種、直徑大於1公分",
