      "exp_en": "The willingness of the health care provider to listen and the content and delivery of information to the patient are more important to how a patient rates their health care provider than the perceived involvement in health decisions. Listening demonstrates concern and a certain amount of humility. Communicating well openly demonstrates respect, allows the patient to judge motivations and identify any shared values, and provides a means to judge competence.tcmtests.com, January 2016",
      "exp_hant": "醫療人員願意傾聽，以及向病患傳達資訊的內容與方式，對病患評價醫療人員的影響，遠大於病患對醫療決策參與程度的感受。傾聽展現關懷與一定程度的謙遜。良好且坦誠的溝通展現尊重，讓病患得以判斷醫療人員的動機、辨識彼此的共同價值觀，並提供判斷專業能力的依據。tcmtests.com，2016年1月"
    },
    {
      "number": 842,
      "question_en": "A 57 year-old male requested acupuncture treatment for shortness of breath. The shortness of breath wakes him after a couple of hours of sleep. He described it as \"fighting for air\" and needed to immediately sit up. He has a history of asthma. Ten years earlier he had a heart attack. He has swelling in both ankles, SOB when walking fast, and some weight gain. He does not have fever, chills, or wheezing. His doctor prescribed a diuretic for blood pressure and for his ankle swelling. However, he stopped taking the medication because he was feeling better. Physical examination showed a BP of 140/88. Lips and nail beds were of normal color. Heart and lung sounds were normal. There was pitting edema 1+ on both ankles. His face looked pale and ashen. Which action would you take?",
      "question_hant": "一名57歲男性因呼吸急促前來要求針灸治療。他睡了幾小時後就會因呼吸急促而醒來，形容自己「像在拼命呼吸」，需要立刻坐起身。他有氣喘病史，十年前曾發生過心臟病發作。他雙側腳踝腫脹，快走時會喘，並有些微體重增加。他沒有發燒、寒顫或喘鳴。醫師曾為他開立利尿劑以治療高血壓及腳踝腫脹，但他因自覺好轉而自行停藥。理學檢查顯示血壓140/88，嘴唇與甲床顏色正常，心肺音正常，雙側腳踝有1+可凹性水腫，面色蒼白灰暗。你會採取什麼行動？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
