      "number": 863,
      "question_en": "Your acupuncture assistant gets blood on their exposed hand and then accidently touches her eyes with it. As an employer what are your responsibilities?",
      "question_hant": "你的針灸助理暴露的手上沾到血液，之後不慎用手碰到眼睛。身為雇主，你有什麼責任？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Refer for medical evaluation, treatment, and follow-up",
