      "exp_en": "The CPT manual is a systematic listing and coding of procedures/services performed by US physicians. It is a physician-related procedure identification system that serves as the basis for health care billing. CPT coding assigns a 5-digit code to each service or procedure provided by a physician. ICD-10 (International Statistical Classfication of Diseases) codes come from the World Health Organization (WHO) and relate to diagnosis. The CPT (Current Procedural Terminology) codes relate to medical procedures and are not affected by the updated version of ICD-10. CPT codes originate from the American Medical Association.tcmtests.com, July 2018",
      "exp_hant": "CPT手冊是對美國醫師所執行程序／服務的系統化列表與編碼，屬於與醫師相關的程序辨識系統，作為醫療計費的依據。CPT編碼為醫師提供的每項服務或程序指定一組5位數代碼。ICD-10（國際疾病統計分類）代碼來自世界衛生組織（WHO），與診斷相關。CPT（當前程序術語）代碼則與醫療程序相關，不受ICD-10更新版本的影響。CPT代碼源自美國醫學會。tcmtests.com，2018年7月"
